{"parentUuid":"ed75c35e-8fa4-452c-ab34-49758339d1c6","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"3cc4353f-9e98-4e90-bdf1-3e268a37427e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017ubgBxPCea2xrUqmPDVX9V","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Karing app diversion region Russia direct rules settings how to bypass Russian sites\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Karing: гайд по обходу блокировок в РФ (обновленный)\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/igareck/vpn-configs-for-russia/issues/216\"},{\"title\":\"Diversion Rules\",\"url\":\"https://karing.app/en/tutorial/diversion\"},{\"title\":\"apps.apple.com\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/app/karing/id6472431552\"},{\"title\":\"Apple ordered to change App Store rules in Russia\",\"url\":\"https://globalcompetitionreview.com/article/apple-ordered-change-app-store-rules-in-russia\"},{\"title\":\"Мы в TelegramПрокси TG\",\"url\":\"https://vpnstatus.site/clients/karing\"},{\"title\":\"github.com\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/KaringX\"},{\"title\":\"www.mactrast.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.mactrast.com/?p=156433\"},{\"title\":\"mp en\",\"url\":\"https://citydrive.ru/faq/mp-en\"},{\"title\":\"apple is now required to offer russian ios users local apps during setup\",\"url\":\"https://www.mactrast.com/2021/04/apple-is-now-required-to-offer-russian-ios-users-local-apps-during-setup/\"},{\"title\":\"Eastern Europe / Tech\",\"url\":\"https://www.intellinews.com/eastern-europe/tech/?offset=20\"},{\"title\":\"github.com\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/KaringX/karing\"},{\"title\":\"www.courthousenews.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.courthousenews.com/?p=335998\"},{\"title\":\"russia curbs whatsapp telegram app calls pushes for homegrown platforms\",\"url\":\"https://san.com/watch-and-listen/russia-curbs-whatsapp-telegram-app-calls-pushes-for-homegrown-platforms\"},{\"title\":\"russia s major mobile carriers warn users to disable vpn for apps to work properly\",\"url\":\"https://meduza.io/en/news/2026/04/15/russia-s-major-mobile-carriers-warn-users-to-disable-vpn-for-apps-to-work-properly\"},{\"title\":\"Apple forced to offer Russian iPhone users local apps at setup thanks to new law,\",\"url\":\"https://www.goodreads.com/author_blog_posts/21141562-apple-forced-to-offer-russian-iphone-users-local-apps-at-setup-thanks-to\"},{\"title\":\"Compatible with sing-box rule-set rules, remove advertising ACL rules, complete GFWList rules, geoip, geosite\",\"url\":\"https://gittrend.io/repo/KaringX/karing-ruleset\"}]\n\nThe search turned up one practical guide for Russia and Karing's official documentation on routing rules.\n\n**Community guide (unofficial):** A GitHub issue titled \"Karing: гайд по обходу блокировок в РФ\" lists a routing setup for Russian services such as banks, government portals, and marketplaces. It uses a built-in geosite:ru rule set as the main match, with geoip:ru added only if it doesn't break calls, and sets the action to Direct. The guide also notes that Autoselect groups switch servers only when the current node degrades or stops responding, not constantly. Since this is a community write-up, verify the rule names against your Karing version.\n\n**Official docs:** Karing's Diversion Rules page says built-in geosite and geoip rules are enabled by default according to Settings → Diversion → Country and Region. The path to change them is Settings → Diversion → GeoSite / GeoIP / ACL, where you enable the switch and select rules. To change the action for a specific rule, go to Settings → Diversion → Diversion Rules, select the rule, and set the action to Direct, Block, Current-Selected, Auto-Selected, or None. Afterward, return to the home screen and disconnect and reconnect to apply the changes. The docs' examples are for mainland China, and I didn't find an explicit Russia entry in the official text.\n\n**Caveats:**\n- Karing is only a client. It doesn't include VPN servers, so you need your own key or subscription. One guide says it works on iOS, Android, Windows, and macOS.\n- A Russian VPN-review site notes that mobile carriers (MTS, MegaFon, Beeline) have warned users to turn off VPNs for their apps to work, which means Direct rules may not fully resolve app issues.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"bc9baf41-2044-4fa3-8e38-464756e6eb2a","timestamp":"2026-11-07T09:23:14.299Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Karing app diversion region Russia direct rules settings how to bypass Russian sites","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01AAPPpMSSi2rebhvJhyFQon","content":[{"title":"Karing: гайд по обходу блокировок в РФ (обновленный)","url":"https://github.com/igareck/vpn-configs-for-russia/issues/216"},{"title":"Diversion Rules","url":"https://karing.app/en/tutorial/diversion"},{"title":"apps.apple.com","url":"https://apps.apple.com/app/karing/id6472431552"},{"title":"Apple ordered to change App Store rules in Russia","url":"https://globalcompetitionreview.com/article/apple-ordered-change-app-store-rules-in-russia"},{"title":"Мы в TelegramПрокси TG","url":"https://vpnstatus.site/clients/karing"},{"title":"github.com","url":"https://github.com/KaringX"},{"title":"www.mactrast.com","url":"https://www.mactrast.com/?p=156433"},{"title":"mp en","url":"https://citydrive.ru/faq/mp-en"},{"title":"apple is now required to offer russian ios users local apps during setup","url":"https://www.mactrast.com/2021/04/apple-is-now-required-to-offer-russian-ios-users-local-apps-during-setup/"},{"title":"Eastern Europe / Tech","url":"https://www.intellinews.com/eastern-europe/tech/?offset=20"},{"title":"github.com","url":"https://github.com/KaringX/karing"},{"title":"www.courthousenews.com","url":"https://www.courthousenews.com/?p=335998"},{"title":"russia curbs whatsapp telegram app calls pushes for homegrown platforms","url":"https://san.com/watch-and-listen/russia-curbs-whatsapp-telegram-app-calls-pushes-for-homegrown-platforms"},{"title":"russia s major mobile carriers warn users to disable vpn for apps to work properly","url":"https://meduza.io/en/news/2026/04/15/russia-s-major-mobile-carriers-warn-users-to-disable-vpn-for-apps-to-work-properly"},{"title":"Apple forced to offer Russian iPhone users local apps at setup thanks to new law,","url":"https://www.goodreads.com/author_blog_posts/21141562-apple-forced-to-offer-russian-iphone-users-local-apps-at-setup-thanks-to"},{"title":"Compatible with sing-box rule-set rules, remove advertising ACL rules, complete GFWList rules, geoip, geosite","url":"https://gittrend.io/repo/KaringX/karing-ruleset"}]},"The search turned up one practical guide for Russia and Karing's official documentation on routing rules.\n\n**Community guide (unofficial):** A GitHub issue titled \"Karing: гайд по обходу блокировок в РФ\" lists a routing setup for Russian services such as banks, government portals, and marketplaces. It uses a built-in geosite:ru rule set as the main match, with geoip:ru added only if it doesn't break calls, and sets the action to Direct. The guide also notes that Autoselect groups switch servers only when the current node degrades or stops responding, not constantly. Since this is a community write-up, verify the rule names against your Karing version.\n\n**Official docs:** Karing's Diversion Rules page says built-in geosite and geoip rules are enabled by default according to Settings → Diversion → Country and Region. The path to change them is Settings → Diversion → GeoSite / GeoIP / ACL, where you enable the switch and select rules. To change the action for a specific rule, go to Settings → Diversion → Diversion Rules, select the rule, and set the action to Direct, Block, Current-Selected, Auto-Selected, or None. Afterward, return to the home screen and disconnect and reconnect to apply the changes. The docs' examples are for mainland China, and I didn't find an explicit Russia entry in the official text.\n\n**Caveats:**\n- Karing is only a client. It doesn't include VPN servers, so you need your own key or subscription. One guide says it works on iOS, Android, Windows, and macOS.\n- A Russian VPN-review site notes that mobile carriers (MTS, MegaFon, Beeline) have warned users to turn off VPNs for their apps to work, which means Direct rules may not fully resolve app issues."],"durationSeconds":7.1534702080000425,"searchCount":1},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"04d0d1f3-5345-4638-b1de-664d4c85152e","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","root":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","branch":"fix/adaptive-headers","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":2,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":2},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Shahen777/nexo-app","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Shahen777/nexo-app","visibility":"public"},{"name":"upstream","host":"github.com","remote":"chen08209/FlClash","visibility":"unknown"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Shahen777/nexo-app","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ed75c35e-8fa4-452c-ab34-49758339d1c6","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.317","gitBranch":"fix/adaptive-headers","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
