{"parentUuid":"abadee02-6748-4c96-b7ff-22214e7bad3b","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_additional_context","content":["Before this session moved to its current folder it ran in a scratch workspace, /Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584, and the files it made there may not all have been copied over; the app may remove that workspace once a week passes without changes to it. That folder is now outside your working directory (reading it needs the user's permission) and the app never shows its location, so don't quote its path to the user."],"hookName":"SessionStart","toolUseID":"SessionStart","hookEvent":"SessionStart"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"52536133-b9af-402b-9064-838f5698dfb5","timestamp":"2026-11-07T19:18:38.816Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nSessionStart hook additional context: Before this session moved to its current folder it ran in a scratch workspace, /Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584, and the files it made there may not all have been copied over; the app may remove that workspace once a week passes without changes to it. That folder is now outside your working directory (reading it needs the user's permission) and the app never shows its location, so don't quote its path to the user.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.317","gitBranch":"fix/adaptive-headers","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
