{"parentUuid":"5b3a789b-adf4-4dc3-afd1-e88b9e2fc74d","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_non_blocking_error","hookName":"PreToolUse:Bash","toolUseID":"toolu_0141abvdjmup4tZXh79ForwN","hookEvent":"PreToolUse","stderr":"Failed with non-blocking status code: No stderr output","stdout":"","exitCode":1,"command":"command hook 2","durationMs":12},"type":"attachment","uuid":"3990ec64-bb26-436e-a4d2-b39bfe932573","timestamp":"2026-11-07T22:31:21.294Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.317","gitBranch":"fix/adaptive-headers","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
{"parentUuid":"5b3a789b-adf4-4dc3-afd1-e88b9e2fc74d","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"39216578-7bc9-46d7-8b42-154505c1dbdc","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0141abvdjmup4tZXh79ForwN","type":"tool_result","content":"* fix/adaptive-headers\n  remotes/origin/fix/adaptive-headers\n  feat/in-app-update\n  remotes/origin/feat/in-app-update\n  main\n  nexo/always-on-vpn\n  remotes/origin/HEAD -> origin/main\n  remotes/origin/main\n== origin/main\n8c4feb0 android: explain when another app's always-on VPN blocks the start\n59e5f41 test: drop unnecessary import\n8c99ef8 style: dart format\n3b94464 polish: open on home, auto-choice server card, macOS icon shape, universal dmg name\n2d42f96 ci: look for the Rust plugin inside rust_api.framework\n3c0745f ci: pass the universal macOS switch to build hooks via user_defines\n== origin/feat/in-app-update\nf087d1d style: dart format\nd927090 feat: renew the subscription from the home screen\n6196d95 chore: version 0.9.4\n46669ea feat: update the app from inside it\n8c4feb0 android: explain when another app's always-on VPN blocks the start\n59e5f41 test: drop unnecessary import\ncb08088 feat(network)!: set desktop TUN key by key over each profile's own\n491fae1 feat(views)!: set DNS, NTP, sniffer and TUN key by key\n1e9955d fix(core,android): stop suspending the Core in Doze\na390a42 feat(config): log DNS queries, override only picked keys and rework settings\n12403b0 build: target Android SDK 37, use Rust 1.98.1 and add a safe mode run\nadf715f refactor(plugins): rework desktop plugins and add rust_api, the helper service, and build hooks\n1477f9b Fix windows tun issues\n76c9f08 Fix issues that TUN repeat failed to open.\n676f2d0 Add windows server mode start process verify\n4e679f7 Optimize performance\nclass _ConnectButton extends ConsumerWidget {\n  const _ConnectButton({\n    required this.isRunning,\n    required this.connecting,\n    required this.runtime,\n  });\n\n  final bool isRunning;\n  final bool connecting;\n  final int? runtime;\n\n  void _toggle(WidgetRef ref) {\n    if (connecting) return;\n    if (system.isAndroid) {\n      unawaited(HapticFeedback.mediumImpact());\n    }\n    ref.read(commonActionProvider.notifier).toggleRunning();\n  }\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context, WidgetRef ref) {\n    final foreground = isRunning ? Colors.white : _textColor(context);\n    final fill = isRunning ? _accent : _cardColor(context);\n    final label = connecting\n        ? NexoStrings.connecting\n        : isRunning\n        ? NexoStrings.connected\n        : NexoStrings.connect;\n    return Center(\n      child: SizedBox.square(\n        dimension: 240,\n        child: Stack(\n          alignment: Alignment.center,\n          children: [\n            if (connecting)\n              const CommonCircleLoading(\n                size: 240,\n                color: _accent,\n                semanticLabel: NexoStrings.connecting,\n              ),\n            AnimatedSwitcher(\n              duration: const Duration(milliseconds: 250),\n              child: SizedBox.square(\n                key: ValueKey((isRunning, connecting)),\n                dimension: 192,\n                child: Material(\n                  color: fill,\n                  elevation: isRunning ? 12 : 4,\n                  shadowColor: _accent.withValues(\n                    alpha: isRunning ? 0.34 : 0.1,\n                  ),\n                  shape: AppShape.circle.copyWith(\n                    side: isRunning\n                        ? BorderSide.none\n                        : const BorderSide(color: _accent, width: 2),\n                  ),\n                  clipBehavior: Clip.antiAlias,\n                  child: InkWell(\n                    customBorder: AppShape.circle,\n                    onTap: connecting ? null : () => _toggle(ref),\n                    child: Column(\n                      mainAxisAlignment: MainAxisAlignment.center,\n                      children: [\n                        Text(\n                          label,\n                          textAlign: TextAlign.center,\n                          style: _manrope(\n                            context,\n                            AppTextStyle.headline,\n                            weight: 650,\n                            color: foreground,\n                          ),\n                        ),\n                        if (isRunning) ...[\n                          const SizedBox(height: 8),\n                          Text(\n                            getTimeText(runtime),\n                            style: _manrope(\n                              context,\n                              AppTextStyle.footnote,\n                              weight: 500,\n                              color: foreground.withValues(alpha: 0.78),\n                            ),\n                          ),\n                        ],\n                      ],\n                    ),\n                  ),\n                ),\n              ),\n            ),\n          ],\n        ),\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n}","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"87911a3b-a687-45c1-830c-f5cc659e481e","timestamp":"2026-11-07T22:31:22.494Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"* fix/adaptive-headers\n  remotes/origin/fix/adaptive-headers\n  feat/in-app-update\n  remotes/origin/feat/in-app-update\n  main\n  nexo/always-on-vpn\n  remotes/origin/HEAD -> origin/main\n  remotes/origin/main\n== origin/main\n8c4feb0 android: explain when another app's always-on VPN blocks the start\n59e5f41 test: drop unnecessary import\n8c99ef8 style: dart format\n3b94464 polish: open on home, auto-choice server card, macOS icon shape, universal dmg name\n2d42f96 ci: look for the Rust plugin inside rust_api.framework\n3c0745f ci: pass the universal macOS switch to build hooks via user_defines\n== origin/feat/in-app-update\nf087d1d style: dart format\nd927090 feat: renew the subscription from the home screen\n6196d95 chore: v