` from `test/helpers/glyph_finders.dart`.\n547:`GlyphIcon` written inside such a button; an icon that reaches the button from elsewhere, as through a helper that picks\n661:- A pane over one painted before it in the same root reads a second image, a level up, with the first drawn in as\n667:  root is the host or its nearest ancestor that draws offscreen: as a backdrop filter would there, it\n669:  `LiquidGlassFade` is no root: as Core Animation fades a layer, its panes still read what lies behind it and fade with\n712:- Without Impeller's shader filters (Skia on the Intel macOS build, `flutter test`) a pane frosts from its capture:\n917:there is none, and everything goes on the root navigator, `rootNavigatorKey` in `lib/ui/navigator.dart`. A route\n923:The root navigator is only for what belongs to no single destination:\n925:- dialogs, which `dialogs` in `lib/common/dialog.dart` hosts on the root unless it is given a context, and the notifier;\n929:Never reach for the root to open a page or sheet from a page, whether through `rootNavigatorKey`,","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"f036e31f-ad46-45c6-8c1e-bfb12cba3f8e","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","root":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","branch":"fix/adaptive-headers","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":2,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":2},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Shahen777/nexo-app","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Shahen777/nexo-app","visibility":"public"},{"name":"upstream","host":"github.com","remote":"chen08209/FlClash","visibility":"unknown"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Shahen777/nexo-app","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","platform":"macos"}},