{"parentUuid":"47579813-2069-4cee-b968-b7b354b3cc30","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"39216578-7bc9-46d7-8b42-154505c1dbdc","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012BSrFioxvoF6nsKMf2RQ1U","type":"tool_result","content":"traffic). Desktop system proxy is deliberately not gated — dropping it would leak traffic direct, so the setting's\ndescription tells users to supply credentials manually instead.\n\n### Local Trust Boundary\n\nThe Windows Helper answers only a connection whose client process runs under the owner SID it was installed for;\nthe Linux Helper only the owner uid. A setuid Core is executable by `root:admin` (macOS) or the installing user's primary\ngroup, so its boundary also includes every member of that group, not just the installing account. Profiles cannot choose\na controller address, a secret or alternate controllers. Another account outside those permissions, a subscription,\nor a remote party reaching the privileged Core's control or filesystem APIs is a vulnerability.\n\nlib/l10n/l10n.dart:413:  /// `TUN works only in administrator mode.`\nlib/l10n/l10n.dart:416:      'TUN works only in administrator mode.',\nlib/l10n/intl/messages_fr.dart:1997:      \"TUN ne fonctionne qu’en mode administrateur.\",\nlib/l10n/intl/messages_es.dart:1994:      \"TUN solo funciona en modo administrador.\",\nlib/l10n/intl/messages_en.dart:1847:      \"TUN works only in administrator mode.\",\nlib/providers/actions/common.dart:213:        mode: LaunchMode.externalApplication,\nlib/providers/actions/setup.dart:326:      final shouldContinueSetup = await requestAdmin(patchConfig.tun.enable);\nlib/providers/actions/setup.dart:657:  Future<bool> requestAdmin(bool enableTun) async {\nlib/providers/actions/setup.dart:729:    final shouldContinueSetup = await requestAdmin(patchConfig.tun.enable);\nlib/common/desktop_updater.dart:41:    launchUrl(file, mode: LaunchMode.externalApplication);\nlib/common/system.dart:98:    return 'chown root:admin $path && chmod 4750 $path';\nlib/common/system.dart:105:        'chown \"root:\\$group\" $path && '\nlib/common/system.dart:106:        'chmod 4750 $path';\nlib/common/system.dart:109:  Future<bool> _isInAdminGroup() async {\nlib/common/system.dart:117:              .contains('admin');\ntotal 274120\n-rwxr-xr-x@ 1 Sagenkazaran  admin  137464608 Nov  7 02:25 FlClashCore\n-rwxr-xr-x@ 1 Sagenkazaran  admin    2881248 Nov  7 02:25 Nexo","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"8c389da2-ab75-4eb5-bbf3-7f197acf4192","timestamp":"2026-11-07T22:31:56.528Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"traffic). Desktop system proxy is deliberately not gated — dropping it would leak traffic direct, so the setting's\ndescription tells users to supply credentials manually instead.\n\n### Local Trust Boundary\n\nThe Windows Helper answers only a connection whose client process runs under the owner SID it was installed for;\nthe Linux Helper only the owner uid. A setuid Core is executable by `root:admin` (macOS) or the installing user's primary\ngroup, so its boundary also includes every member of that group, not just the installing account. Profiles cannot choose\na controller address, a secret or alternate controllers. Another account outside those permissions, a subscription,\nor a remote party reaching the privileged Core's control or filesystem APIs is a vulnerability.\n\nlib/l10n/l10n.dart:413:  /// `TUN works only in administrator mode.`\nlib/l10n/l10n.dart:416:      'TUN works only in administrator mode.',\nlib/l10n/intl/messages_fr.dart:1997:      \"TUN ne fonctionne qu’en mode administrateur.\",\nlib/l10n/intl/messages_es.dart:1994:      \"TUN solo funciona en modo administrador.\",\nlib/l10n/intl/messages_en.dart:1847:      \"TUN works only in administrator mode.\",\nlib/providers/actions/common.dart:213:        mode: LaunchMode.externalApplication,\nlib/providers/actions/setup.dart:326:      final shouldContinueSetup = await requestAdmin(patchConfig.tun.enable);\nlib/providers/actions/setup.dart:657:  Future<bool> requestAdmin(bool enableTun) async {\nlib/providers/actions/setup.dart:729:    final shouldContinueSetup = await requestAdmin(patchConfig.tun.enable);\nlib/common/desktop_updater.dart:41:    launchUrl(file, mode: LaunchMode.externalApplication);\nlib/common/system.dart:98:    return 'chown root:admin $path && chmod 4750 $path';\nlib/common/system.dart:105:        'chown \"root:\\$group\" $path && '\nlib/common/system.dart:106:        'chmod 4750 $path';\nlib/common/system.dart:109:  Future<bool> _isInAdminGroup() async {\nlib/common/system.dart:117:              .contains('admin');\ntotal 274120\n-rwxr-xr-x@ 1 Sagenkazaran  admin  137464608 Nov  7 02:25 FlClashCore\n-rwxr-xr-x@ 1 Sagenkazaran  admin    2881248 Nov  7 02:25 Nexo","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"bd94dbeb-ce74-4055-aedb-55c5405a87a4","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","root":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","branch":"fix/adaptive-headers","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":2,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":2},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Shahen777/nexo-app","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Shahen777/nexo-app","visibility":"public"},{"name":"upstream","host":"github.com","remote":"chen08209/FlClash","visibility":"unknown"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Shahen777/nexo-app","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"47579813-2069-4cee-b968-b7b354b3cc30","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe