ate during the conversation.\n\nCurrent branch: feat/desktop-tun\n\nMain branch (you will usually use this for PRs): main\n\nGit user: Shahen\n\nStatus:\nM .claude/settings.json\n M .codex/config.toml\n?? .codex/hooks.json\n?? .entire/\n\nRecent commits:\n412f687 feat(network): turn on TUN once on macOS and Windows\nd3b2a1c test: align privacy heading assertion with Nexo terms\n61548ae style: dart format\n1f2855d fix(copy): align usage terms with Nexo service\n4854076 style: dart format\n\nClaude Code attached this context automatically; it isn't part of the user's message. It describes the user's own account and workspace, so they don't need it reported back.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"user","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.317","gitBranch":"feat/desktop-tun","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
