t directory, so a planted `json.py` runs on `import json`. Run any Python that reads them with `-I`. This does not apply to code the user asked you to build or run.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.317","gitBranch":"feat/desktop-tun","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
