{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","hash":"9f560313cf860cc7b6feff4f18811ad13d822004a9e947f675a3ce57850fc47c","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Господин Шаген, Nexo 0.9.10 опубликован. Я проверил по публичному адресу сервера, что выложенные файлы совпадают с собранными, контрольные суммы одинаковые.\n\n**Что теперь получают клиенты:**\n- **Windows:** уже установленный Nexo предложит обновиться до 0.9.10 внутри приложения.\n- **Новые установки на Windows и Mac:** ссылки, которые даёт бот, теперь ведут на 0.9.10, раньше там была старая 0.9.2.\n- **Режим TUN:** при первом запуске новой версии он включится сам, и система один раз попросит разрешение администратора. Если клиент откажет, Nexo продолжит работать через системный прокси, как раньше.\n\n**Что не изменилось:**\n- **Уже установленные Nexo на Mac** останутся на 0.9.9: автообновлению нужен appcast, подписанный ключом Sparkle, а этот ключ у Codex. Если Codex подпишет appcast для файла `Nexo-0.9.10-macos-universal.dmg`, Mac-клиенты тоже получат обновление.\n- **Android** остался на 0.9.9: для него в этой версии ничего не поменялось.\n\n**Если что-то пойдёт не так:** старые update.json и оба файла для новых установок сохранены на сервере в `/root/nexo-backups/updater-0.9.10-20261107T233136Z`, откатиться можно за минуту.\n\n**Не проверено:** TUN на живом компьютере с Windows. Если клиенты на Windows начнут жаловаться, сразу напишите мне. Изменения приложения лежат в ветке `feat/desktop-tun`, в main они не влиты. Всё записал в Obsidian."}]}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","hash":"47b00101c50942210e844a098bca488009fface5321c3a2ae77365083ecffa42","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<system-reminder>\nAttribution for git commits and pull requests you create from here on (this replaces Claude Code's own earlier attribution guidance, such as a previous copy of this reminder; the user's own instructions about these lines, such as a CLAUDE.md or memory rule, take precedence over this reminder, but do not add attribution lines this reminder leaves out):\n- End git commit messages with:\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n- End pull request descriptions with:\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nThe user can follow this conversation from another device; to put a file in front of them there (a report, a screenshot, a built artifact), send it with SendUserFile.\n</system-reminder>\n"},{"type":"text","text":"А как включить tun"}]}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","hash":"97a34e2573b5271c3ecfacebff565a0732310799bb5a290510e204fbef447fdc","message":{"role":"system","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The following skills are available for use with the Skill tool:\n\n- claude-mem:version-bump: Maintainer release workflow for the thedotmack/claude-mem repository only. Handles version increments across package.json, marketplace.json, plugin.json manifests, build verification, git tagging, GitHub releases, and changelog generation. npm publishing is done by the tag-triggered GitHub Actions workflow through npm trusted publishing. Does not apply to any other repository or npm package.\n\nCalled the Read tool with the following input: {\"file_path\":\"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/publish_0910.py\"}\nResult of calling the Read tool:\n1\timport fcntl\n2\timport hashlib\n3\timport json\n4\timport os\n5\timport shutil\n6\timport sys\n7\timport tempfile\n8\timport time\n9\tfrom pathlib import Path\n10\t\n11\tstage = Path(sys.argv[1])\n12\troot = Path('/opt/nexo-bot/assets/downloads')\n13\tFILES = {\n14\t    'Nexo-0.9.10-windows-amd64-setup.exe': '3eb7441923b71554a515747257d9170bc3b371833d56e65e492262edb35543fe',\n15\t    'Nexo-0.9.10-macos-universal.dmg': '8d9f75cb148569863f8b5b77c8b83347b9ed06baba348e513498c8ae6e7f6013',\n16\t}\n17\tSTABLE = {\n18\t    'Nexo-windows-setup.exe': 'Nexo-0.9.10-windows-amd64-setup.exe',\n19\t    'Nexo-macos.dmg': 'Nexo-0.9.10-macos-universal.dmg',\n20\t}\n21\tBODY = ('- Все программы на компьютере теперь идут через VPN (режим TUN включается сам).\\n'\n22\t        '- Один раз система попросит разрешение администратора; без него Nexo работает как раньше.')\n23\t\n24\t\n25\tdef digest(path):\n26\t    with path.open('rb') as stream:\n27\t        return hashlib.file_digest(stream, 'sha256').hexdigest()\n28\t\n29\t\n30\tdef atomic_copy(source, destination, mode, uid, gid):\n31\t    fd, temporary = tempfile.mkstemp(prefix='.' + destination.name + '.', dir=root)\n32\t    try:\n33\t        with os.fdopen(fd, 'wb') as out, source.open('rb') as src:\n34\t            shutil.copyfileobj(src, out)\n35\t            out.flush()\n36\t            os.fsync(out.fileno())\n37\t        os.chmod(temporary, mode)\n38\t        os.chown(temporary, uid, gid)\n39\t        os.replace(temporary, destination)\n40\t    finally:\n41\t        if os.path.exists(temporary):\n42\t            os.unlink(temporary)\n43\t\n44\t\n45\tfor name, sha in FILES.items():\n46\t    assert digest(stage / name) == sha, name\n47\t\n48\twith (root / '.update-publication.lock').open('a') as lock:\n49\t    fcntl.flock(lock, fcntl.LOCK_EX)\n50\t    manifest_path = root / 'update.json'\n51\t    previous = manifest_path.read_bytes()\n52\t    manifest = json.loads(previous)\n53\t    assert manifest['windows']['version'] == '0.9.9', manifest['windows']['version']\n54\t    backup = Path('/root/nexo-backups') / time.strftime('updater-0.9.10-%Y%m%dT%H%M%SZ', time.gmtime())\n55\t    backup.mkdir(mode=0o700, parents=True)\n56\t    (backup / 'update.json').write_bytes(previous)\n57\t    for stable in STABLE:\n58\t        shutil.copyfile(root / stable, backup / stable)\n59\t    owner = manifest_path.stat()\n60\t    for name, sha in FILES.items():\n61\t        destination = root / name\n62\t        if destination.exists():\n63\t            assert digest(destination) == sha, 'Immutable asset conflict ' + name\n64\t        else:\n65\t            atomic_copy(stage / name, destination, 0o644, owner.st_uid, owner.st_gid)\n66\t        assert digest(destination) == sha\n67\t    for stable, versioned in STABLE.items():\n68\t        atomic_copy(root / versioned, root / stable, 0o644, owner.st_uid, owner.st_gid)\n69\t        assert digest(root / stable) == FILES[versioned]\n70\t    release = dict(manifest['windows'])\n71\t    release.update(version='0.9.10', file='download/Nexo-0.9.10-windows-amd64-setup.exe',\n72\t                   sha256=FILES['Nexo-0.9.10-windows-amd64-setup.exe'], body=BODY)\n73\t    manifest['windows'] = release\n74\t    data = (json.dumps(manifest, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2) + '\\n').encode()\n75\t    fd, temporary = tempfile.mkstemp(prefix='.update.json.', dir=root)\n76\t    with os.fdopen(fd, 'wb') as out:\n77\t        out.write(data)\n78\t        out.flush()\n79\t        os.fsync(out.fileno())\n80\t    os.chmod(temporary, owner.st_mode & 0o777)\n81\t    os.chown(temporary, owner.st_uid, owner.st_gid)\n82\t    os.replace(temporary, manifest_path)\n83\t    print(json.dumps({'backup': str(backup), 'windows': manifest['windows']['version'],\n84\t                      'macos_manifest': manifest['macos']['version']}))\n85\t\n\nCalled the Read tool with the following input: {\"file_path\":\"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/tasks/b6cg0cszy.output\"}\nResult of calling the Read tool:\n1\tsuccess\n2\tandroid\tsuccess\n3\twindows\tsuccess\n4\tmacos\tsuccess\n5\tui\tskipped\n6\t\n7\t[exited with code 0]\n8\t\n\nCalled the Read tool with the following input: {\"file_path\":\"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/services_patch.py\"}\nResult of calling the Read tool:\n1\timport sys\n2\tfrom pathlib import Path\n3\t\n4\troot = Path(sys.argv[1])\n5\t\n6\t\n7\tdef patch(path, pairs):\n8\t    file = root / path\n9\t    text = file.read_text()\n10\t    for old, new in pairs:\n11\t        assert text.count(old) == 1, (path, old)\n12\t        text = text.replace(old, new)\n13\t    file.write_text(text)\n14\t\n15\t\n16\tpatch('nexo_client.py', [\n17\t    (\"\"\"PROBE_URL = 'https://www.gstatic.com/generate_204'\n18\t\"\"\", \"\"\"PROBE_URL = 'https://www.gstatic.com/generate_204'\n19\t\n20\t# Each service gets its own choice of server; «Nexo» there means «the same as the main choice».\n21\tSERVICES = (\n22\t    ('YouTube', ('youtube.com', 'youtu.be', 'googlevideo.com', 'ytimg.com', 'ggpht.com', 'youtube-nocookie.com',\n23\t                 'youtubei.googleapis.com'), ()),\n24\t    ('Instagram и WhatsApp', ('instagram.com', 'cdninstagram.com', 'facebook.com', 'facebook.net', 'fbcdn.net', 'fb.com',\n25\t                              'fbsbx.com', 'whatsapp.com', 'whatsapp.net', 'threads.net'), ()),\n26\t    ('Telegram', ('telegram.org', 't.me', 'telegram.me', 'telesco.pe', 'tdesktop.com', 'telegra.ph'),\n27\t     ('91.108.4.0/22', '91.108.8.0/22', '91.108.12.0/22', '91.108.16.0/22', '91.108.20.0/22', '91.108.56.0/22',\n28\t      '95.161.64.0/20', '149.154.160.0/20', '185.76.151.0/24', '2001:b28:f23c::/48', '2001:b28:f23d::/48',\n29\t      '2001:b28:f23f::/48', '2001:67c:4e8::/48', '2a0a:f280::/32')),\n30\t    ('Нейросети', ('openai.com', 'chatgpt.com', 'oaistatic.com', 'oaiusercontent.com', 'x.ai', 'grok.com',\n31\t                   'anthropic.com', 'claude.ai', 'gemini.google.com', 'perplexity.ai'), ()),\n32\t    ('TikTok', ('tiktok.com', 'tiktokv.com', 'tiktokcdn.com', 'tiktokcdn-us.com', 'byteoversea.com', 'ibytedtos.com',\n33\t                'ibyteimg.com', 'muscdn.com'), ()),\n34\t    ('X (Twitter)', ('x.com', 'twitter.com', 'twimg.com', 't.co'), ()),\n35\t    ('Discord', ('discord.com', 'discord.gg', 'discordapp.com', 'discordapp.net', 'discord.media'), ()),\n36\t    ('Spotify', ('spotify.com', 'scdn.co', 'spotifycdn.com'), ()),\n37\t)\n38\t\n39\t\n40\tdef _service_rules():\n41\t    rules = []\n42\t    for name, domains, nets in SERVICES:\n43\t        rules += [f'DOMAIN-SUFFIX,{domain},{name}' for domain in domains]\n44\t        rules += [f\"{'IP-CIDR6' if ':' in net else 'IP-CIDR'},{net},{name},no-resolve\" for net in nets]\n45\t    return rules\n46\t\"\"\"),\n47\t    (\"\"\"    rules += _site_rule()\n48\t    rules.append(f'MATCH,{SELECT}')\"\"\", \"\"\"    rules += _site_rule()\n49\t    services = len(visible_names) > 1\n50\t    if services:\n51\t        rules += _service_rules()\n52\t    rules.append(f'MATCH,{SELECT}')\"\"\"),\n53\t    (\"\"\"            *([vienna_group] if vienna_group else []),\n54\t        ],\"\"\", \"\"\"            *([vienna_group] if vienna_group else []),\n55\t            *([{'name': name, 'type': 'select', 'proxies': [SELECT, *visible_names]} for name, _, _ in SERVICES]\n56\t              if services else []),\n57\t        ],\"\"\"),\n58\t])\n59\t\n60\tpatch('tests/test_hy2.py', [\n61\t    (\"\"\"        self.assertEqual(groups['Автовыбор']['type'],'fallback')\n62\t\"\"\", \"\"\"        self.assertEqual(groups['Автовыбор']['type'],'fallback')\n63\t\n64\t    def test_each_service_picks_its_own_server_after_the_direct_list(self):\n65\t        raw = f'vless://{KEY}@192.0.2.1:443?type=tcp&security=tls&sni=vpn.example.test&flow=xtls-rprx-vision#Vienna\\\\n'\n66\t        raw += f'vless://{KEY}@192.0.2.2:443?type=tcp&security=reality&sni=www.example.test&pbk=pk&sid=ab#Brazil'\n67\t        with patch.dict(os.environ, {'NEXO_HY2_SERVER':'192.0.2.1','NEXO_HY2_OBFS':'test-obfs'}):\n68\t            result = nexo_client.profile(base64.b64encode(raw.encode()).decode())\n69\t        groups = {g['name']:g for g in result['proxy-groups']}\n70\t        self.assertEqual(groups['YouTube'], {'name':'YouTube','type':'select','proxies':['Nexo','🇦🇹 Nexo — Вена','Brazil']})\n71\t        rules = result['rules']\n72\t        self.assertIn('DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googlevideo.com,YouTube', rules)\n73\t        self.assertIn('IP-CIDR,149.154.160.0/20,Telegram,no-resolve', rules)\n74\t        self.assertIn('DOMAIN-SUFFIX,grok.com,Нейросети', rules)\n75\t        self.assertLess(rules.index('DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gosuslugi.ru,DIRECT'), rules.index('DOMAIN-SUFFIX,youtube.com,YouTube'))\n76\t        self.assertEqual(rules[-1], 'MATCH,Nexo')\n77\t        targets = {rule.split(',')[2] for rule in rules if rule.count(',') >= 2}\n78\t        self.assertTrue(targets <= {'DIRECT', *groups})\n79\t\n80\t    def test_a_single_server_gets_no_service_choices(self):\n81\t        raw = f'vless://{KEY}@192.0.2.2:443?type=tcp&security=reality&sni=www.example.test&pbk=pk&sid=ab#Brazil'\n82\t        result = nexo_client.profile(base64.b64encode(raw.encode()).decode())\n83\t        self.assertEqual([g['name'] for g in result['proxy-groups']], ['Nexo', 'Автовыбор'])\n84\t\"\"\"),\n85\t])\n86\tprint('patched')\n87\t\n\nCalled the Read tool with the following input: {\"file_path\":\"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app/.github/workflows/nexo.yaml\"}\nResult of calling the Read tool:\n1\tname: nexo-build\n2\t\n3\t# Builds the Nexo app for Android, macOS and Windows; started by hand from the Actions tab.\n4\ton:\n5\t  workflow_dispatch:\n6\t    inputs:\n7\t      ui_only:\n8\t        description: Run UI checks without packaging\n9\t        type: boolean\n10\t        default: false\n11\t      skip_native_tests:\n12\t        description: Skip macOS native tests when native code is unchanged\n13\t        type: boolean\n14\t        default: false\n15\t      baseline:\n16\t        description: Optional baseline commit for reproducing header regressions\n17\t        type: string\n18\t        default: ''\n19\t\n20\tenv:\n21\t  FLUTTER_VERSION: '3.47.6'\n22\t  GO_VERSION: '1.27.1'\n23\t  NDK_VERSION: r28c\n24\t\n25\tjobs:\n26\t  ui:\n27\t    if: inputs.ui_only\n28\t    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n29\t    steps:\n30\t      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n31\t        with:\n32\t          fetch-depth: 0\n33\t      - uses: subosito/flutter-action@v2\n34\t        with:\n35\t          channel: stable\n36\t          flutter-version: ${{ env.FLUTTER_VERSION }}\n37\t          cache: true\n38\t      - uses: Swatinem/rust-cache@v2\n39\t        with:\n40\t          workspaces: plugins/rust_api/rust\n41\t      - name: Get Flutter dependencies\n42\t        run: flutter pub get\n43\t      - name: Fetch CA certificates\n44\t        shell: bash\n45\t        env:\n46\t          CA_BUNDLE: cacert-2026-09-25.pem\n47\t          CA_BUNDLE_SHA256: a41b5d356aea97a529fe27e0f7316d2f9d946d75927476cf9cf1b90637d00505\n48\t        run: |\n49\t          bundle=core/Clash.Meta/component/ca/ca-certificates.crt\n50\t          mkdir -p \"$(dirname \"$bundle\")\"\n51\t          curl -fsSL --retry 3 -o \"$bundle\" \"https://curl.se/ca/$CA_BUNDLE\"\n52\t          echo \"$CA_BUNDLE_SHA256  $bundle\" | sha256sum -c -\n53\t      - name: Check format\n54\t        run: dart format --output=none --set-exit-if-changed lib test tool plugins setup.dart\n55\t      - name: Analyze\n56\t        run: flutter analyze --no-fatal-infos\n57\t      - name: Skip the unused Go core build hook\n58\t        run: yq -i '.hooks.user_defines.setup.build_assets = false' pubspec.yaml\n59\t      - name: Reproduce regressions on baseline\n60\t        if: inputs.baseline != ''\n61\t        shell: bash\n62\t        env:\n63\t          NEXO_BASELINE: ${{ inputs.baseline }}\n64\t        run: |\n65\t          set -euo pipefail\n66\t          [[ \"$NEXO_BASELINE\" =~ ^[0-9a-f]{7,40}$ ]]\n67\t          files=(lib/ui/scaffold.dart lib/ui/sheet_header.dart lib/views/nexo/home.dart)\n68\t          restore_sources() { git restore -- \"${files[@]}\"; }\n69\t          trap restore_sources EXIT\n70\t          for file in \"${files[@]}\"; do git show \"$NEXO_BASELINE:$file\" > \"$file\"; done\n71\t          if flutter test test/widgets/views_smoke_test.dart test/widgets/scrollbar_inset_test.dart --name 'Nexo automatic selection|toolbar masks' --reporter expanded; then\n72\t            echo 'Expected the regression checks to fail against the baseline' >&2\n73\t            exit 1\n74\t          fi\n75\t      - name: Test widgets\n76\t        run: dart run tool/test.dart test/widgets test/common/dialog_test.dart test/common/request_test.dart test/common/desktop_updater_test.dart test/common/update_download_test.dart test/l10n test/lint/dynamic_message_key_test.dart test/providers/common_action_test.dart test/setup_test.dart -- --reporter expanded\n77\t\n78\t  build:\n79\t    if: ${{ !inputs.ui_only }}\n80\t    name: ${{ matrix.platform }}\n81\t    runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}\n82\t    env:\n83\t      HAS_KEYSTORE: ${{ secrets.KEYSTORE != '' }}\n84\t      NEXO_MAC_UNIVERSAL: ${{ matrix.universal || '' }}\n85\t    strategy:\n86\t      fail-fast: false\n87\t      matrix:\n88\t        include:\n89\t          - platform: android\n90\t            os: ubuntu-latest\n91\t          - platform: macos\n92\t            os: macos-15-intel\n93\t            universal: '1'\n94\t            artifact: nexo-macos-universal\n95\t          - platform: windows\n96\t            os: windows-2022\n97\t    steps:\n98\t      - name: Checkout\n99\t        uses: actions/checkout@v4\n100\t        with:\n101\t          submodules: recursive\n102\t\n103\t      - name: Setup Android signing\n104\t        if: matrix.platform == 'android' && env.HAS_KEYSTORE == 'true'\n105\t        env:\n106\t          KEYSTORE: ${{ secrets.KEYSTORE }}\n107\t        run: |\n108\t          echo \"$KEYSTORE\" | base64 --decode > android/app/keystore.jks\n109\t          {\n110\t            echo \"keyAlias=${{ secrets.KEY_ALIAS }}\"\n111\t            echo \"storePassword=${{ secrets.STORE_PASSWORD }}\"\n112\t            echo \"keyPassword=${{ secrets.KEY_PASSWORD }}\"\n113\t          } >> android/local.properties\n114\t\n115\t      - name: Setup Go\n116\t        uses: actions/setup-go@v5\n117\t        with:\n118\t          go-version: ${{ env.GO_VERSION }}\n119\t          cache-dependency-path: core/go.sum\n120\t\n121\t      - name: Setup Gradle\n122\t        if: matrix.platform == 'android'\n123\t        uses: gradle/actions/setup-gradle@v6\n124\t\n125\t      - name: Enable git long paths (Windows)\n126\t        if: matrix.platform == 'windows'\n127\t        run: git config --global core.longpaths true\n128\t\n129\t      - name: Setup Flutter\n130\t        uses: subosito/flutter-action@v2\n131\t        with:\n132\t          channel: stable\n133\t          flutter-version: ${{ env.FLUTTER_VERSION }}\n134\t          cache: true\n135\t\n136\t      - name: Setup Xcode\n137\t        if: matrix.platform == 'macos'\n138\t        run: |\n139\t          # newest Xcode the runner image has (macos-14 images do not ship Xcode 26)\n140\t          latest=$(ls -d /Applications/Xcode_*.app | sort -V | tail -1)\n141\t          sudo xcode-select -s \"$latest\"\n142\t          xcodebuild -version\n143\t\n144\t      - name: Install macOS Rust targets\n145\t        if: matrix.platform == 'macos'\n146\t        working-directory: plugins/rust_api/rust\n147\t        run: rustup target add aarch64-apple-darwin x86_64-apple-darwin\n148\t\n149\t      - name: Setup NDK\n150\t        if: matrix.platform == 'android'\n151\t        uses: nttld/setup-ndk@v1\n152\t        id: build-ndk\n153\t        with:\n154\t          ndk-version: ${{ env.NDK_VERSION }}\n155\t          add-to-path: true\n156\t          link-to-sdk: true\n157\t\n158\t      # Build hooks see a filtered environment, so the universal switch goes through pubspec user_defines.\n159\t      - name: Enable universal macOS core\n160\t        if: matrix.platform == 'macos' && matrix.universal\n161\t        run: |\n162\t          python3 - <<'PY'\n163\t          p = 'pubspec.yaml'\n164\t          s = open(p).read()\n165\t          s = s.replace('    setup:\\n      build_assets: true\\n',\n166\t                        '    setup:\\n      build_assets: true\\n      macos_universal: true\\n', 1)\n167\t          assert 'macos_universal: true' in s\n168\t          open(p, 'w').write(s)\n169\t          PY\n170\t\n171\t      - name: Get Flutter dependencies\n172\t        run: flutter pub get\n173\t\n174\t      - name: Fetch CA certificates\n175\t        shell: bash\n176\t        env:\n177\t          CA_BUNDLE: cacert-2026-09-25.pem\n178\t          CA_BUNDLE_SHA256: a41b5d356aea97a529fe27e0f7316d2f9d946d75927476cf9cf1b90637d00505\n179\t        run: |\n180\t          bundle=core/Clash.Meta/component/ca/ca-certificates.crt\n181\t          curl -fsSL --retry 3 -o \"$bundle\" \"https://curl.se/ca/$CA_BUNDLE\"\n182\t          echo \"$CA_BUNDLE_SHA256  $bundle\" | { command -v sha256sum >/dev/null && sha256sum -c - || shasum -a 256 -c -; }\n183\t\n184\t      - name: Test update code\n185\t        if: matrix.platform == 'android'\n186\t        run: flutter test test/common/request_test.dart test/common/migration_test.dart test/widgets/update_dialog_test.dart test/l10n/localization_contract_test.dart test/setup_test.dart\n187\t\n188\t      - name: Test macOS updater\n189\t        if: matrix.platform == 'macos' && !inputs.skip_native_tests\n190\t        shell: bash\n191\t        run: |\n192\t          flutter build macos --debug --dart-define=SAFE_MODE=true\n193\t          xcodebuild test -workspace macos/Runner.xcworkspace -scheme Runner \\\n194\t            -configuration Debug -destination 'platform=macOS,arch=x86_64' \\\n195\t            -only-testing:RunnerTests -parallel-testing-enabled NO \\\n196\t            -derivedDataPath build/macos CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY=- \\\n197\t            CODE_SIGN_STYLE=Manual DEVELOPMENT_TEAM='' -quiet\n198\t\n199\t      - name: Build\n200\t        shell: bash\n201\t        env:\n202\t          ANDROID_NDK_HOME: ${{ steps.build-ndk.outputs.ndk-path }}\n203\t          NEXO_UPDATE_URL: ${{ secrets.NEXO_UPDATE_URL }}\n204\t        run: dart setup.dart ${{ matrix.platform }} --env stable -v\n205\t\n206\t      - name: Verify universal macOS app\n207\t        if: matrix.platform == 'macos'\n208\t        shell: bash\n209\t        run: |\n210\t          set -euo pipefail\n211\t          dmgs=(./dist/*.dmg)\n212\t          if [ \"${#dmgs[@]}\" -ne 1 ] || [ ! -f \"${dmgs[0]}\" ]; then\n213\t            echo 'Expected exactly one DMG in dist' >&2\n214\t            exit 1\n215\t          fi\n216\t          mountpoint=$(mktemp -d)\n217\t          mounted=0\n218\t          cleanup() {\n219\t            if [ \"$mounted\" -eq 1 ]; then hdiutil detach \"$mountpoint\"; fi\n220\t            rmdir \"$mountpoint\"\n221\t          }\n222\t          trap cleanup EXIT\n223\t          hdiutil attach \"${dmgs[0]}\" -readonly -nobrowse -mountpoint \"$mountpoint\"\n224\t          mounted=1\n225\t          app=\"$mountpoint/Nexo.app\"\n226\t          check_slices() {\n227\t            local binary=\"$1\" slices arch\n228\t            slices=$(lipo -archs \"$binary\")\n229\t            echo \"$binary: $slices\"\n230\t            for arch in arm64 x86_64; do\n231\t              case \" $slices \" in\n232\t                *\" $arch \"*) ;;\n233\t                *) echo \"Missing $arch in $binary\" >&2; return 1 ;;\n234\t              esac\n235\t            done\n236\t          }\n237\t          check_slices \"$app/Contents/MacOS/Nexo\"\n238\t          check_slices \"$app/Contents/MacOS/FlClashCore\"\n239\t          rust_library=$(find \"$app/Contents/Frameworks\" -path '*rust_api.framework/*' -name rust_api -type f -print -quit)\n240\t          if [ -z \"$rust_library\" ]; then\n241\t            echo 'Rust native asset not found in the app' >&2\n242\t            exit 1\n243\t          fi\n244\t          check_slices \"$rust_library\"\n245\t          check_slices \"$app/Contents/Frameworks/Sparkle.framework/Versions/B/Sparkle\"\n246\t          python3 - \"$app/Contents/Info.plist\" <<'PY'\n247\t          import base64, plistlib, sys\n248\t          with open(sys.argv[1], 'rb') as f:\n249\t              built = plistlib.load(f)\n250\t          with open('macos/Runner/Info.plist', 'rb') as f:\n251\t              source = plistlib.load(f)\n252\t          key = built['SUPublicEDKey']\n253\t          assert key == source['SUPublicEDKey']\n254\t          assert len(base64.b64decode(key, validate=True)) == 32\n255\t          assert built['SURequireSignedFeed'] is True\n256\t          assert built['SUVerifyUpdateBeforeExtraction'] is True\n257\t          assert built['SUSignedFeedFailureExpirationInterval'] == 0\n258\t          PY\n259\t          codesign --verify --deep --strict \"$app\"\n260\t\n261\t      - name: Upload\n262\t        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4\n263\t        with:\n264\t          name: ${{ matrix.artifact || format('nexo-{0}', matrix.platform) }}\n265\t          path: ./dist\n266\t          retention-days: 14\n267\t\n\nNote: /Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app/test/common/migration_test.dart was read before the last conversation was summarized, but the contents are too large to include. Use Read tool if you need to access it.\n\nThe following tools just became available and are ready to use:\nReadNotifications\n\nThe following deferred tools are now available via ToolSearch. Their schemas are NOT loaded — calling them directly will fail with InputValidationError. Use ToolSearch with query \"select:<name>[,<name>...]\" to load tool schemas before calling them:\nArtifactComments\nArtifactData\nCronCreate\nCronDelete\nCronList\nDesignSync\nEnterPlanMode\nEnterWorktree\nExitPlanMode\nExitWorktree\nFetchInboxMessage\nListMcpResourcesTool\nListPlugins\nListSkills\nMonitor\nNotebookEdit\nPushNotification\nReadMcpResourceDirTool\nReadMcpResourceTool\nRemoteTrigger\nSearchSkills\nSendMessage\nSendToProject\nSendToProjectContext\nTaskStop\nWebFetch\nWebSearch\nmcp__1a59c906-04da-521d-bda7-7f71b9f9e01c__create\nmcp__1a59c906-04da-521d-bda7-7f71b9f9e01c__delete\nmcp__1a59c906-04da-521d-bda7-7f71b9f9e01c__export\nmcp__1a59c906-04da-521d-bda7-7f71b9f9e01c__query\nmcp__1a59c906-04da-521d-bda7-7f71b9f9e01c__read\nmcp__Claude_Code_iOS_Simulator__build\nmcp__ccd_connectors__reconnect_session_connector\nmcp__ccd_connectors__session_connectors_status\nmcp__ccd_connectors__set_session_connector_enabled\nmcp__ccd_directory__change_directory\nmcp__ccd_directory__propose_branch\nmcp__ccd_directory__request_directory\nmcp__ccd_host__clean_up_worktrees\nmcp__ccd_host__discard_kept_worktree\nmcp__ccd_host__get_storage_usage\nmcp__ccd_host__open_in_editor\nmcp__ccd_host__request_keep_awake\nmcp__ccd_host__reveal_path\nmcp__ccd_host__sync_with_base_branch\