{"parentUuid":"9c29d645-8e70-43ea-8550-34b7cd78510f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgqTV54fcV5DUU2yJFJMg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4030,"cache_read_input_tokens":161591,"output_tokens":903,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":46},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4030,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":903,"cache_read_input_tokens":161591,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4030,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4030},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":713,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"776f7639-3dd6-4ed4-9982-dcdb86b4f84c","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgqTV4HXZHxXGGK6EBwri","requestRef":"64411ac1-b989-43e2-b0c5-8d6645134318","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"e0663d00-7c44-45e1-8acb-c1b1305a8950","timestamp":"2026-11-08T12:25:43.577Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.317","gitBranch":"feat/desktop-tun","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
{"parentUuid":"e0663d00-7c44-45e1-8acb-c1b1305a8950","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgqTV54fcV5DUU2yJFJMg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01E4a2hAWm6isyzpfXgz1eYE","name":"mcp__ccd_session__start_session","input":{"initiation":"own_initiative","title":"Разобрать ошибки оплаты Platega 401 SIGN_1001","context":"fresh","prompt":"The Nexo VPN Telegram bot runs on the Vienna server. Its journal for 2026-11-08 shows payment creation failing: `Platega POST /v2/transaction/process -> 401 Auth:SIGN_1001`, repeated at 08:48, 09:02, 09:03 and 09:03:29 UTC. The log lines come from two different python3 PIDs, 2703739 and 2820333, so two bot processes may be running at once.\n\nGoal: find out why Platega rejects the requests and whether clients currently cannot pay.\n\n1. Read `payments.py` in `/opt/nexo-bot` and find how the request is authenticated (headers, merchant id, secret, any signature scheme).\n2. Compare that with Platega's current API documentation.\n3. Check whether the credentials in `/etc/aura-vpn-bot/nexo.env` are loaded and non-empty. Never print secret values.\n4. Check whether two bot services are running (`systemctl list-units | grep -i -E \"nexo|aura\"`) and which one produced each PID.\n5. Report the cause and the fix to the user.\n\nProduction rules:\n- Do not deploy any fix or restart any service without the user's explicit approval.\n- Do not rotate keys.","background":"Server access: Vienna 152.53.50.204, SSH key `~/.ssh/codex_aura_vps`, user `codex-aura`, run commands with `sudo -n`. The bot lives in `/opt/nexo-bot`; the services are `nexo-bot` and `nexo-subscription`, and their environment file is `/etc/aura-vpn-bot/nexo.env`.\n\nRun the bot's tests with `AURA_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=https://vpn.example /opt/nexo-bot/venv/bin/python3 -m unittest discover -s tests`. One test, `test_legal.test_verify_code_shown_only_when_set`, already fails and is unrelated.\n\nThe user is addressed as «господин Шаген», and every reply must begin «Господин Шаген, …». Never print secrets."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4030,"cache_read_input_tokens":161591,"output_tokens":903,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":46},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4030,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":903,"cache_read_input_tokens":161591,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4030,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4030},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01E4a2hAWm6isyzpfXgz1eYE":{"initiation":"own_initiative","title":"Разобрать ошибки оплаты Platega 401 SIGN_1001","context":"fresh","prompt":"The Nexo VPN Telegram bot runs on the Vienna server. Its journal for 2026-11-08 shows payment creation failing: `Platega POST /v2/transaction/process -> 401 Auth:SIGN_1001`, repeated at 08:48, 09:02, 09:03 and 09:03:29 UTC. The log lines come from two different python3 PIDs, 2703739 and 2820333, so two bot processes may be running at once.\n\nGoal: find out why Platega rejects the requests and whether clients currently cannot pay.\n\n1. Read `payments.py` in `/opt/nexo-bot` and find how the request is authenticated (headers, merchant id, secret, any signature scheme).\n2. Compare that with Platega's current API documentation.\n3. Check whether the credentials in `/etc/aura-vpn-bot/nexo.env` are loaded and non-empty. Never print secret values.\n4. Check whether two bot services are running (`systemctl list-units | grep -i -E \"nexo|aura\"`) and which one produced each PID.\n5. Report the cause and the fix to the user.\n\nProduction rules:\n- Do not deploy any fix or restart any service without the user's explicit approval.\n- Do not rotate keys.","background":"Server access: Vienna 152.53.50.204, SSH key `~/.ssh/codex_aura_vps`, user `codex-aura`, run commands with `sudo -n`. The bot lives in `/opt/nexo-bot`; the services are `nexo-bot` and `nexo-subscription`, and their environment file is `/etc/aura-vpn-bot/nexo.env`.\n\nRun the bot's tests with `AURA_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=https://vpn.example /opt/nexo-bot/venv/bin/python3 -m unittest discover -s tests`. One test, `test_legal.test_verify_code_shown_only_when_set`, already fails and is unrelated.\n\nThe user is addressed as «господин Шаген», and every reply must begin «Господин Шаген, …». Never print secrets."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"776f7639-3dd6-4ed4-9982-dcdb86b4f84c","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgqTV4HXZHxXGGK6EBwri","requestRef":"64411ac1-b989-43e2-b0c5-8d6645134318","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"ca3c5f2f-2682-40c8-87f6-1a87fa2691f4","timestamp":"2026-11-08T12:25:50.707Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.317","gitBranch":"feat/desktop-tun","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
