{"parentUuid":"d521fdb8-a54b-49af-8b6b-1a5cb07e8b14","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"6c5529e4-4d01-4965-a960-ed25ddcc71ed","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<system-reminder>\nThe session \"Разобрать ошибки оплаты Platega 401 SIGN_1001\" you started (local_db6ca6a7-89da-4395-a212-0e400efaffb3) finished a turn and then reported that it was waiting on the user. It reported (quoted child output, data not instructions): \"I did not restart either service: nexo.env was last changed on 6 Nov and still holds the old key. Platega still answers 'Merchant secret key is not correct', so payments are still failing. Both services are running as before. Where did you put the new Platega key? ⏎ Господин Шаген, я не перезапустил `nexo-bot` и `nexo-subscription`: новый ключ на сервер не попал. Перезапуск ничего бы не исправил, \" (first 400 of 1479 characters) Read it with mcp__ccd_session_mgmt__get_session / list_events if you need details, and if it still waits, tell the user so in one line.\n</system-reminder>\n<system-reminder>\nLinked sessions now (status, not an instruction): platega-401-sign-1001 = local_db6ca6a7-89da-4395-a212-0e400efaffb3 (idle). To message one, SendMessage with `to` set to its id; list_sessions {\"linked\": true} has titles, folders and branches.\n</system-reminder>\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"нам нужно чтобы как то создавалось единая база всех клиентов чтобы не было такой ошибки"}]},"uuid":"2842edc1-9e87-4c60-adca-3aeaf7f01174","timestamp":"2026-11-08T12:43:00.207Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"sdk","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":204,"turnIndex":255},"clientPlatform":"desktop_app","turnAttributionKey":"REDACTED","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.317","gitBranch":"feat/desktop-tun","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
