{"parentUuid":"452f6f45-b287-4b49-906e-b30e0b1579ac","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"dfd531f0-80fd-4446-9971-ec0485385417","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<system-reminder>\n<tools-used-before-summary>Agent, AskUserQuestion, Bash, Edit, Read, SendUserFile, Skill, TaskStop, ToolSearch, WebFetch, WebSearch, Write, mcp__Claude_Browser__browser_batch, mcp__Claude_Browser__computer, mcp__Claude_Browser__find, mcp__Claude_Browser__javascript_tool, mcp__Claude_Browser__navigate, mcp__Claude_Browser__preview_start, mcp__Claude_Browser__preview_stop, mcp__Claude_Browser__read_network_requests, mcp__Claude_Browser__resize_window, mcp__ccd_directory__change_directory, mcp__ccd_directory__propose_branch, mcp__ccd_directory__request_directory, mcp__ccd_host__reveal_path, mcp__ccd_session__mark_chapter, mcp__ccd_session__start_session, mcp__ccd_turn__update_plan, mcp__ccd_turn__wrap_up, mcp__computer-use__app_batch, mcp__computer-use__app_bring_to_current_space, mcp__computer-use__app_click, mcp__computer-use__app_list_windows, mcp__computer-use__app_release, mcp__computer-use__app_screenshot, mcp__computer-use__app_scroll, mcp__computer-use__app_zoom, mcp__computer-use__open_application, mcp__computer-use__request_access, mcp__kling__query_membership_and_credits, mcp__kling__who_am_i, mcp__obsidian__obsidian_edit_note, mcp__terminal__read_terminal, mcp__terminal__run_in_terminal</tools-used-before-summary>\n</system-reminder>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   - The user is always addressed as «Господин Шаген», and every reply must begin «Господин Шаген, …».\n   - The user runs the Nexo VPN service.\n   - Requests in this segment, in order:\n     1. How to turn TUN on.\n     2. Why Brazil is unavailable, then fix it via Vienna.\n     3. Count how many users there are, who they are and which devices they use.\n     4. Make sure a single unified client database exists so the stale-DB confusion cannot happen again. The user chose \"Одна база\" (one DB) and \"Команда в боте\" (an admin command in the bot).\n     5. What can be done to fix Brazil.\n     6. Latest: \"сейчас все работает у всех?\" (does everything work for everyone now?).\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - **Server:** Vienna 152.53.50.204.\n     - SSH: `~/.ssh/codex_aura_vps`, user codex-aura, `sudo -n`. Code is in `/opt/nexo-bot` (git).\n     - Env file: `/etc/aura-vpn-bot/nexo.env`, which sets `AURA_DB_PATH=/opt/aura-vpn-bot-next/aura_vpn.db`. `/etc/aura-vpn-bot/aura-vpn.env` has the same path.\n     - Services:\n       - nexo-bot (@NexoConnect_bot)\n       - nexo-subscription (serves nexo_client profiles)\n       - nexo-hysteria, nexo-hysteria-karing\n       - nexo-hy2-auth (reads the x-ui DB `/etc/x-ui/x-ui.db` and adds Hysteria traffic into x-ui client_traffics)\n       - aura-vpn-bot-next, aura-vpn-subscription\n       - aura-brazil-panel-tunnel\n       - x-ui (3x-ui panels)\n   - **Nodes (runtime_config):**\n     - vienna_fast (inbound 7, enabled)\n     - brazil 187.77.44.160:1443 (Reality, sni www.google.com, inbound 3, enabled)\n     - russia and vienna_https (disabled)\n   - **Panel email patterns:** `aura_d_{device_id}-{node}` for devices; `tg_{tg_id}-{node}` for legacy users.\n     - `/panel/api/inbounds/list` returns an empty list.\n     - `/panel/api/inbounds/get/{id}` has no traffic in clientStats.\n     - Per-email `getClientTraffics/{email}` works and includes `lastOnline` in ms.\n   - **Deploy pattern:**\n     1. Stage: `sudo cp -a /opt/nexo-bot /tmp/stg`, chown, run the patch script.\n     2. Test: `AURA_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=https://vpn.example /opt/nexo-bot/venv/bin/python3 -m unittest discover -s tests`. One known pre-existing failure: test_legal.test_verify_code_shown_only_when_set.\n     3. Install with `install -o $(stat -c %u f) -g $(stat -c %g f) -m $(stat -c %a f)`.\n     4. Commit: `sudo -n git -c safe.directory=/opt/nexo-bot -c user.name=Claude -c user.email=noreply@anthropic.com commit` with the trailer \"Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\".\n     5. Restart the services.\n   - **Read-only scripts against live data:** source nexo.env and set `PYTHONPATH=/opt/nexo-bot`. Use a snapshot DB made with the sqlite backup API into `/tmp/snapdb` (umask 077), because importing database.py runs init_db, which writes.\n   - **mihomo `dialer-proxy`:** chains Brazil through the Vienna fallback group.\n   - **Brazil block:** the Mac's home ISP blocks 187.77.44.160 on all ports (tested with `nc -z -G 5 -b en0`). Vienna is reachable.\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - **/opt/nexo-bot/nexo_client.py** (commit 6c509d6, \"Nexo profile: reach other countries through Vienna first\"). Inside `profile()`, in the hysteria branch:\n     ```python\n     relayed_groups = []\n     ...\n         relayed = []\n         for proxy in proxies:\n             if proxy['server'] == server:\n                 continue\n             name = proxy['name']\n             proxy['name'] = f'{name} напрямую'\n             relayed.append({**proxy, 'name': f'{name} через Вену', 'dialer-proxy': country})\n             relayed_groups.append({'name': name, 'type': 'fallback', 'proxies': [f'{name} через Вену', proxy['name']],\n                                    'url': PROBE_URL, 'interval': 60, 'timeout': 5000, 'lazy': False})\n         proxies += relayed\n     ```\n     `*relayed_groups,` is inserted after vienna_group in proxy-groups. The test `test_other_countries_are_reached_through_vienna_first` was added to tests/test_hy2.py.\n   - **/opt/nexo-bot/database.py** (commit 28ebe92):\n     - `DB_PATH = os.environ.get(\"AURA_DB_PATH\")`.\n     - `get_db()` raises `RuntimeError(\"AURA_DB_PATH is not set: all bots and services share one client database\")` when DB_PATH is empty, with a comment explaining the stale-DB history.\n     - The module-level `init_db()` now runs only `if DB_PATH:`.\n     - Added `from collections import Counter`.\n     - Added `client_overview()`:\n       - Selects users `WHERE merged_into IS NULL`, active devices, and payments.\n       - Returns dicts with: tg_id, username, first_name, created_at, paid_until, legacy (bool), devices (Counter of platforms), device_nodes [(id, node_keys)], payments {tried, paid, revenue}.\n   - **/opt/nexo-bot/xui_api.py:** added\n     ```python\n     async def get_client_usage(self, email: str) -> tuple[int, int] | None:\n         \"\"\"Bytes used and the last connection in epoch ms, 0 when never seen.\"\"\"\n     ```\n     It calls `getClientTraffics/{email}`.\n   - **/opt/nexo-bot/diagnostics.py:** added `async def client_usage(clients, nodes, client_factory=XUIClient)`:\n     - Builds jobs per enabled node; logs in once per panel.\n     - Uses Semaphore(24) with a 6 s timeout per call.\n     - Returns `{tg_id: (bytes, last_ms)}`.\n   - **/opt/nexo-bot/handlers/admin.py:**\n     - Added constants: PLATFORMS (ios→iPhone, android, androidtv→Android TV, macos→Mac, windows), MOSCOW = UTC+3, PAGE = 15.\n     - Added `usage()`: 300 s cache, `wait_for(client_usage(clients, get_nodes()), timeout=30)`, returns None on failure.\n     - `stats_text()` is now async and shows: accounts (Telegram/сайт), new today, срок идёт/истёк/без срока, devices by platform, «Пользовались VPN» за сутки/неделю/ни разу, payments.\n     - Added `_client_text()`.\n     - `admin_users` uses the filter `F.data.regexp(r\"^admin_users(:\\d+)?$\")`, pages through clients sorted by last seen, with ‹ › buttons and «< Управление».\n   - **/opt/nexo-bot/tests/test_navigation.py:**\n     - Added imports `Counter` and `AsyncMock`.\n     - Patches `client_overview` (returns []) and `admin.usage` (AsyncMock returning None).\n     - The HTML-escape test now uses a client_overview fixture.\n   - **/opt/nexo-bot/tests/test_client_overview.py** (new), three tests:\n     - a missing path raises an error;\n     - each person appears once with devices and payments (merged users excluded);\n     - usage sums across servers and skips disabled ones.\n   - **Stale DBs archived** to `/root/nexo-backups/stale-client-dbs-<ts>/`:\n     - `/opt/nexo-bot/aura_vpn.db`\n     - `/opt/nexo-hy2-candidate/aura_vpn.db`\n     - `/opt/nexo-hy2-baseline/aura_vpn.db`\n     - `/opt/aura-vpn-bot/aura_vpn.db`\n     None of them had data missing from the live DB.\n   - **Scratchpad scripts** in /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/: chain_patch.py, clients_patch.py, node_diag.py, brazil_e2e.py, users_report.py, usage_report.py, render_admin.py, now_report.py, direct_probe.py, stale_diff.py, probe_list.py.\n   - **Obsidian note** «Проекты/VPN-инфраструктура.md» (vault \"vault\"): appended entries for the Brazil chain, the user counts, and the unified DB + /admin work.\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **SSH key probing to Brazil and the Obsidian grep:** denied by the classifier (Credential Exploration). I stopped and did not work around it.\n   - **ModuleNotFoundError runtime_config** in remote scripts: fixed with `PYTHONPATH=/opt/nexo-bot`.\n   - **First DB query read the stale /opt/nexo-bot/aura_vpn.db (0 users):** the real path comes from AURA_DB_PATH. This triggered the unified-DB work.\n   - **Zero traffic from inbound clientStats / StopIteration on the list endpoint:** switched to per-email getClientTraffics.\n   - **Mac IP_BOUND_IF Python probe failed even for Vienna:** used `nc -b en0` instead.\n   - **test_access import failed with RuntimeError:** caused by the module-level init_db; fixed with `if DB_PATH: init_db()`.\n   - **Read-only URI DB failed** (init_db writes): used a sqlite backup snapshot instead.\n   - **/admin summary took 21 s:** raised the semaphore from 8 to 24, giving 12 s, with a 5-minute cache.\n   - **Wrong claim corrected:** I had said Hysteria traffic was not counted. hy2_auth does account it into Vienna's client_traffics, and I told the user so.\n   - **Window resized and the user may have been typing in Nexo:** I released the computer-use apps afterwards.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - **Brazil:**\n     - Nexo chains it through Vienna, verified at 263 ms.\n     - Happ/Karing raw links still go direct and are blocked.\n     - Options given to the user:\n       1. Vienna relay inbound forwarding to Brazil (recommended).\n       2. A new Hostinger IP (risky: Hostinger ranges get blocked).\n       3. A server in another country.\n   - **Payments:** no payment has ever succeeded. PLATEGA_SECRET is wrong. The session [Разобрать ошибки оплаты Platega 401 SIGN_1001](#local_db6ca6a7-89da-4395-a212-0e400efaffb3) is waiting for the user to paste a new key through a prepared hidden-prompt command.\n   - **Current health check:**\n     - Every service is active; load is low.\n     - The only warnings are x-ui «LimitIP access log path» noise.\n     - Active users: 13 in the last 15 min, 16 in 24h.\n     - Online now: Vienna 9, Brazil 0.\n     - Stopped using: igolga23 (last 31.10), Olga (08.10), dianfilka (26.09).\n     - 30 accounts never connected.\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - \"А как включить tun\"\n   - \"привет а почему у нас боазилия не доступно?\"\n   - \"сервер?\"\n   - \"Да, через Вену\"\n   - \"посмотри сколько всего у нас пользователей нашего впн как понять и кто?\"\n   - \"с каких устройст и так далее\"\n   - \"нам нужно чтобы как то создавалось единая база всех клиентов чтобы не было такой ошибки\". The user answered the follow-up questions with \"Одна база (Recommended)\" and \"Команда в боте (Recommended)\".\n   - \"а что у нас с бразилей что нам можно сделать как поченить ?\"\n   - \"сейчас все работает у всех?\"\n   - Standing rules from CLAUDE.md and AGENTS.md (keep in force):\n     - Address the user «господин Шаген» and start every reply «Господин Шаген, …».\n     - Record projects in Obsidian.\n     - «`.env`, ключи API, токены и приватные документы клиентов **никогда не коммитить**».\n     - «Логин (`entire login`) и пуш чекпойнтов на серверы Entire **не выполнять без явного разрешения Шагена**».\n     - In the nexo-app repo:\n       - «Never add a `Co-authored-by` trailer crediting a coding agent to a commit». This applies to nexo-app; server /opt/nexo-bot commits do use the Claude trailer.\n       - «Start FlClash on the host only as a safe mode build, and end only processes you started, by recorded pid. Never kill a FlClash instance by name».\n       - Comment density ≤5%; use `flutter test`.\n     - Never print secrets; mask uuid, pbk, sid and passwords.\n     - Do not search for or handle the Sparkle signing key or SSH keys for other servers (the classifier denies it).\n     - Never enter passwords.\n     - Do not send Telegram messages on the user's behalf without permission.\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - Write the closing text message answering \"сейчас все работает у всех?\". wrap_up has already been called.\n   - Awaiting the user's answer to the wrap_up question «Сделать для Happ и Karing бразильский вход через Вену?» (buttons: «Да, сделай» / «Пока не надо»).\n   - The Platega session is waiting for the user's new secret key.\n   - Not requested now, left over from earlier:\n     - the Mac appcast needs signing by Codex;\n     - feat/desktop-tun is not merged;\n     - TUN on Windows is unverified.\n\n8. Current Work:\n   - Just finished the health check for \"сейчас все работает у всех?\".\n   - wrap_up was called with this recap: «Вена работает: все сервисы запущены, за последние 15 минут подключались 13 человек, ошибок нет. Бразилия работает только в Nexo, через Вену. В Happ и Karing она недоступна, и оплаты по-прежнему не проходят.» and the ask «Сделать для Happ и Karing бразильский вход через Вену?».\n   - The closing message still needs to be written. It should say:\n     - Yes for Vienna: all services are up; 13 people in the last 15 min and 16 today, with the list of active names and times (МСК).\n     - Brazil works only in Nexo (via Vienna); Happ and Karing users choosing Brazil get nothing.\n     - Payments are still broken until the new Platega key is entered.\n     - Three people stopped using the service (igolga23, Olga, dianfilka), and 30 accounts never connected.\n     - Do not repeat the wrap_up question.\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   - Write the closing reply, starting «Господин Шаген, …», summarizing the health check as described in section 8.\n   - Then wait for the user's answer to «Сделать для Happ и Karing бразильский вход через Вену?».\n   - If they say yes, build an xray relay inbound on Vienna that forwards to the Brazil outbound, and point the Brazil links for Happ/Karing at Vienna. Do not start that without their confirmation.\n\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: /Users/Sagenkazaran/.claude/projects/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb.jsonl\nContinue the conversation from where it left off without asking the user any further questions. Resume directly — do not acknowledge the summary, do not recap what was happening, do not preface with \"I'll continue\" or similar. Pick up the last task as if the break never happened.\n\nThe messages after this summary are the most recent messages from before compaction, kept verbatim. The summary was written without seeing them, so something it says has not happened yet may already have happened in them."},"isVisibleInTranscriptOnly":true,"isCompactSummary":true,"uuid":"5005dc0e-cc12-4970-8348-d5a4fbe4880e","timestamp":"2026-11-08T14:34:54.114Z","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":206,"turnIndex":257},"turnOrigin":"human","summarizedTurnPromptUuids":["a85d36a8-f55d-47e5-acc2-38fa69860466"],"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.317","gitBranch":"feat/desktop-tun","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
{"parentUuid":"5005dc0e-cc12-4970-8348-d5a4fbe4880e","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"compact_file_reference","filename":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/clients_patch.py","displayPath":"../../../../private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/clients_patch.py"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"c80db4fc-beb7-4613-ba1b-e6bbfbef4ac5","timestamp":"2026-11-08T23:10:59.371Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nNote: /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/clients_patch.py was read before the last conversation was summarized, but the contents are too large to include. Use Read tool if you need to access it.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.317","gitBranch":"feat/desktop-tun","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
{"parentUuid":"c80db4fc-beb7-4613-ba1b-e6bbfbef4ac5","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"file","filename":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/usage_report.py","content":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/usage_report.py","content":"import asyncio\nimport collections\nimport os\nimport sqlite3\nimport time\n\nfrom runtime_config import get_nodes\nfrom xui_api import XUIClient\n\ndb = sqlite3.connect(f\"file:{os.environ['AURA_DB_PATH']}?mode=ro\", uri=True)\nprint('payment attempts by user:', db.execute(\n    \"select count(distinct tg_id), group_concat(distinct tariff) from payments\").fetchone())\nprint('payments by day:', db.execute(\n    \"select substr(created_at,1,10), status, count(*) from payments group by 1,2 order by 1\").fetchall())\nprint('payment amounts:', db.execute(\"select amount, count(*) from payments group by 1\").fetchall())\ndevice_of = {}\nfor tg_id, uuid, platform, status in db.execute('select tg_id, uuid, platform, status from devices'):\n    device_of[uuid] = (tg_id, platform, status)\nfor tg_id, uuid in db.execute('select tg_id, vpn_uuid from users where vpn_uuid is not null'):\n    device_of.setdefault(uuid, (tg_id, 'legacy', 'legacy'))\n\n\nasync def main():\n    now = time.time() * 1000\n    seen = collections.defaultdict(lambda: [0, 0])\n    unknown = 0\n    for node in get_nodes():\n        client = XUIClient(node.key)\n        if not await client.login():\n            print(node.key, 'login failed')\n            continue\n        result = await client._request('GET', f'/panel/api/inbounds/get/{client.inbound_id}')\n        inbound = result['obj']\n        import json\n        settings = json.loads(inbound['settings']) if isinstance(inbound['settings'], str) else inbound['settings']\n        email_uuid = {c.get('email'): c.get('id') for c in settings.get('clients', [])}\n        online = await client._request('POST', '/panel/api/inbounds/onlines')\n        online = set(online.get('obj') or []) if isinstance(online, dict) else set()\n        used = day = 0\n        if not node.enabled:\n            continue\n        for email, uuid in email_uuid.items():\n            raw = await client._request('GET', f'/panel/api/inbounds/getClientTraffics/{email}')\n            stat = raw.get('obj') if isinstance(raw, dict) and isinstance(raw.get('obj'), dict) else {}\n            total = (stat.get('up') or 0) + (stat.get('down') or 0)\n            last = stat.get('lastOnline') or 0\n            key = device_of.get(uuid)\n            if key is None:\n                unknown += 1\n                continue\n            entry = seen[key[0]]\n            entry[0] += total\n            entry[1] = max(entry[1], last)\n            used += total > 0\n            day += last > now - 86400000\n        print(node.key, 'enabled', node.enabled, 'clients', len(email_uuid), 'with traffic', used,\n              'seen 24h', day, 'online now', len(online & set(email_uuid)))\n    print('panel clients not in DB', unknown)\n    names = dict(db.execute(\"select tg_id, coalesce(nullif(username,''), first_name) from users\").fetchall())\n    rows = sorted(seen.items(), key=lambda kv: -kv[1][0])\n    for tg_id, (total, last) in rows:\n        when = time.strftime('%d.%m %H:%M', time.gmtime(last / 1000)) if last else '-'\n        print(f'{names.get(tg_id, tg_id)!s:22} {total / 2**30:8.2f} GB  last {when}')\n    print('users with any traffic', sum(1 for _, (t, _) in rows if t > 0),\n          'active last 24h', sum(1 for _, (_, l) in rows if l > now - 86400000),\n          'last 7d', sum(1 for _, (_, l) in rows if l > now - 7 * 86400000))\n\n\nasyncio.run(main())\n","numLines":70,"startLine":1,"totalLines":70}},"displayPath":"../../../../private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/usage_report.py"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"62eb6a57-be56-4750-b10d-44e4f0c6563c","timestamp":"2026-11-08T23:10:59.371Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nCalled the Read tool with the following input: {\"file_path\":\"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/usage_report.py\"}\n</system-reminder>"},{"content":"<system-reminder>\nResult of calling the Read tool:\n1\timport asyncio\n2\timport collections\n3\timport os\n4\timport sqlite3\n5\timport time\n6\t\n7\tfrom runtime_config import get_nodes\n8\tfrom xui_api import XUIClient\n9\t\n10\tdb = sqlite3.connect(f\"file:{os.environ['AURA_DB_PATH']}?mode=ro\", uri=True)\n11\tprint('payment attempts by user:', db.execute(\n12\t    \"select count(distinct tg_id), group_concat(distinct tariff) from payments\").fetchone())\n13\tprint('payments by day:', db.execute(\n14\t    \"select substr(created_at,1,10), status, count(*) from payments group by 1,2 order by 1\").fetchall())\n15\tprint('payment amounts:', db.execute(\"select amount, count(*) from payments group by 1\").fetchall())\n16\tdevice_of = {}\n17\tfor tg_id, uuid, platform, status in db.execute('select tg_id, uuid, platform, status from devices'):\n18\t    device_of[uuid] = (tg_id, platform, status)\n19\tfor tg_id, uuid in db.execute('select tg_id, vpn_uuid from users where vpn_uuid is not null'):\n20\t    device_of.setdefault(uuid, (tg_id, 'legacy', 'legacy'))\n21\t\n22\t\n23\tasync def main():\n24\t    now = time.time() * 1000\n25\t    seen = collections.defaultdict(lambda: [0, 0])\n26\t    unknown = 0\n27\t    for node in get_nodes():\n28\t        client = XUIClient(node.key)\n29\t        if not await client.login():\n30\t            print(node.key, 'login failed')\n31\t            continue\n32\t        result = await client._request('GET', f'/panel/api/inbounds/get/{client.inbound_id}')\n33\t        inbound = result['obj']\n34\t        import json\n35\t        settings = json.loads(inbound['settings']) if isinstance(inbound['settings'], str) else inbound['settings']\n36\t        email_uuid = {c.get('email'): c.get('id') for c in settings.get('clients', [])}\n37\t        online = await client._request('POST', '/panel/api/inbounds/onlines')\n38\t        online = set(online.get('obj') or []) if isinstance(online, dict) else set()\n39\t        used = day = 0\n40\t        if not node.enabled:\n41\t            continue\n42\t        for email, uuid in email_uuid.items():\n43\t            raw = await client._request('GET', f'/panel/api/inbounds/getClientTraffics/{email}')\n44\t            stat = raw.get('obj') if isinstance(raw, dict) and isinstance(raw.get('obj'), dict) else {}\n45\t            total = (stat.get('up') or 0) + (stat.get('down') or 0)\n46\t            last = stat.get('lastOnline') or 0\n47\t            key = device_of.get(uuid)\n48\t            if key is None:\n49\t                unknown += 1\n50\t                continue\n51\t            entry = seen[key[0]]\n52\t            entry[0] += total\n53\t            entry[1] = max(entry[1], last)\n54\t            used += total > 0\n55\t            day += last > now - 86400000\n56\t        print(node.key, 'enabled', node.enabled, 'clients', len(email_uuid), 'with traffic', used,\n57\t              'seen 24h', day, 'online now', len(online & set(email_uuid)))\n58\t    print('panel clients not in DB', unknown)\n59\t    names = dict(db.execute(\"select tg_id, coalesce(nullif(username,''), first_name) from users\").fetchall())\n60\t    rows = sorted(seen.items(), key=lambda kv: -kv[1][0])\n61\t    for tg_id, (total, last) in rows:\n62\t        when = time.strftime('%d.%m %H:%M', time.gmtime(last / 1000)) if last else '-'\n63\t        print(f'{names.get(tg_id, tg_id)!s:22} {total / 2**30:8.2f} GB  last {when}')\n64\t    print('users with any traffic', sum(1 for _, (t, _) in rows if t > 0),\n65\t          'active last 24h', sum(1 for _, (_, l) in rows if l > now - 86400000),\n66\t          'last 7d', sum(1 for _, (_, l) in rows if l > now - 7 * 86400000))\n67\t\n68\t\n69\tasyncio.run(main())\n70\t\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.317","gitBranch":"feat/desktop-tun","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
{"parentUuid":"62eb6a57-be56-4750-b10d-44e4f0c6563c","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"file","filename":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/users_report.py","content":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/users_report.py","content":"import collections\nimport sqlite3\nimport sys\n\ndb = sqlite3.connect(f'file:{sys.argv[1]}?mode=ro', uri=True)\ndb.row_factory = sqlite3.Row\nSKIP = {'vless_link', 'token', 'uuid', 'vpn_uuid', 'request_id', 'node_targets', 'referral_code'}\n\nfor table in ('users', 'devices', 'payments'):\n    print(table, [r[1] for r in db.execute(f'pragma table_info({table})')])\n\nuser_cols = [r[1] for r in db.execute('pragma table_info(users)')]\nprint('\\nusers total', db.execute('select count(*) from users').fetchone()[0])\nfor col in ('is_active', 'is_premium', 'server', 'brand', 'bot', 'platform', 'app', 'source'):\n    if col in user_cols:\n        print(col, dict(db.execute(f'select {col}, count(*) from users group by 1').fetchall()))\nexpiry = next((c for c in user_cols if 'expir' in c or c.endswith('_until') or c == 'paid_until'), None)\nif expiry:\n    print('expiry column', expiry)\n    print('with access now', db.execute(f\"select count(*) from users where {expiry} > datetime('now')\").fetchone()[0])\nprint('by signup day', db.execute(\"select substr(created_at,1,10) d, count(*) from users group by d order by d\").fetchall())\n\nprint('\\ndevices', db.execute('select count(*) from devices').fetchone()[0])\nprint('device status', dict(db.execute('select status, count(*) from devices group by 1').fetchall()))\nprint('device platform', dict(db.execute(\"select platform, count(*) from devices where status='active' group by 1\").fetchall()))\nprint('users with an active device', db.execute(\"select count(distinct tg_id) from devices where status='active'\").fetchone()[0])\n\nprint('\\npayments', dict(db.execute('select status, count(*) from payments group by 1').fetchall()))\nprint('paid sum', db.execute(\"select tariff, count(*), sum(amount) from payments where status='paid' group by 1\").fetchall())\n\ndevices = collections.defaultdict(list)\nfor row in db.execute(\"select tg_id, platform, label, status from devices\"):\n    devices[row['tg_id']].append(f\"{row['platform']}{'' if row['status'] == 'active' else '(' + row['status'] + ')'}\")\npaid = dict(db.execute(\"select tg_id, count(*) from payments where status='paid' group by 1\").fetchall())\ncols = [c for c in user_cols if c not in SKIP]\nprint('\\nLIST', cols)\nfor row in db.execute('select * from users order by created_at'):\n    shown = {c: row[c] for c in cols if c in ('username', 'first_name', 'created_at', 'is_active', 'is_premium', 'server')\n             or c == expiry}\n    print(row['tg_id'], shown, 'devices:', ','.join(devices.get(row['tg_id'], [])) or '-', 'paid:', paid.get(row['tg_id'], 0))\n","numLines":41,"startLine":1,"totalLines":41}},"displayPath":"../../../../private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/users_report.py"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"bd7220bf-a9ae-46b4-8fa8-58c31efe2a43","timestamp":"2026-11-08T23:10:59.371Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nCalled the Read tool with the following input: {\"file_path\":\"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/users_report.py\"}\n</system-reminder>"},{"content":"<system-reminder>\nResult of calling the Read tool:\n1\timport collections\n2\timport sqlite3\n3\timport sys\n4\t\n5\tdb = sqlite3.connect(f'file:{sys.argv[1]}?mode=ro', uri=True)\n6\tdb.row_factory = sqlite3.Row\n7\tSKIP = {'vless_link', 'token', 'uuid', 'vpn_uuid', 'request_id', 'node_targets', 'referral_code'}\n8\t\n9\tfor table in ('users', 'devices', 'payments'):\n10\t    print(table, [r[1] for r in db.execute(f'pragma table_info({table})')])\n11\t\n12\tuser_cols = [r[1] for r in db.execute('pragma table_info(users)')]\n13\tprint('\\nusers total', db.execute('select count(*) from users').fetchone()[0])\n14\tfor col in ('is_active', 'is_premium', 'server', 'brand', 'bot', 'platform', 'app', 'source'):\n15\t    if col in user_cols:\n16\t        print(col, dict(db.execute(f'select {col}, count(*) from users group by 1').fetchall()))\n17\texpiry = next((c for c in user_cols if 'expir' in c or c.endswith('_until') or c == 'paid_until'), None)\n18\tif expiry:\n19\t    print('expiry column', expiry)\n20\t    print('with access now', db.execute(f\"select count(*) from users where {expiry} > datetime('now')\").fetchone()[0])\n21\tprint('by signup day', db.execute(\"select substr(created_at,1,10) d, count(*) from users group by d order by d\").fetchall())\n22\t\n23\tprint('\\ndevices', db.execute('select count(*) from devices').fetchone()[0])\n24\tprint('device status', dict(db.execute('select status, count(*) from devices group by 1').fetchall()))\n25\tprint('device platform', dict(db.execute(\"select platform, count(*) from devices where status='active' group by 1\").fetchall()))\n26\tprint('users with an active device', db.execute(\"select count(distinct tg_id) from devices where status='active'\").fetchone()[0])\n27\t\n28\tprint('\\npayments', dict(db.execute('select status, count(*) from payments group by 1').fetchall()))\n29\tprint('paid sum', db.execute(\"select tariff, count(*), sum(amount) from payments where status='paid' group by 1\").fetchall())\n30\t\n31\tdevices = collections.defaultdict(list)\n32\tfor row in db.execute(\"select tg_id, platform, label, status from devices\"):\n33\t    devices[row['tg_id']].append(f\"{row['platform']}{'' if row['status'] == 'active' else '(' + row['status'] + ')'}\")\n34\tpaid = dict(db.execute(\"select tg_id, count(*) from payments where status='paid' group by 1\").fetchall())\n35\tcols = [c for c in user_cols if c not in SKIP]\n36\tprint('\\nLIST', cols)\n37\tfor row in db.execute('select * from users order by created_at'):\n38\t    shown = {c: row[c] for c in cols if c in ('username', 'first_name', 'created_at', 'is_active', 'is_premium', 'server')\n39\t             or c == expiry}\n40\t    print(row['tg_id'], shown, 'devices:', ','.join(devices.get(row['tg_id'], [])) or '-', 'paid:', paid.get(row['tg_id'], 0))\n41\t\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.317","gitBranch":"feat/desktop-tun","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
{"parentUuid":"bd7220bf-a9ae-46b4-8fa8-58c31efe2a43","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"file","filename":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/tasks/bnvrh6ek0.output","content":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/tasks/bnvrh6ek0.output","content":"config.py:17:# Brand shown in the bot UI. Several bots (Aura VPN, Nexo) share this code and the database.\ndatabase.py:1:\"\"\"AuraVPN Database — SQLite\"\"\"\ndatabase.py:10:DB_PATH = os.environ.get(\ndatabase.py:11:    \"AURA_DB_PATH\",\ndatabase.py:12:    os.path.join(os.path.dirname(__file__), \"aura_vpn.db\"),\ndatabase.py:17:    conn = sqlite3.connect(DB_PATH)\nAURA_DB_PATH=\n-rw-r--r-- 1 shagen shagen 102400 Nov  6 15:59 /opt/nexo-bot/aura_vpn.db\nlrwxrwxrwx 1 root   root       21 Sep 26 13:16 /var/lib/aura-openflux -> private/aura-openflux\n/home/shagen/migration/aura-vpn-bot-next-src/aura_vpn.db\n/opt/aura-vpn-bot/aura_vpn.db\n/opt/aura-vpn-bot-next/backups/aura_vpn-before-payments-20261031-223613.db\n/opt/aura-vpn-bot-next/backups/aura_vpn-before-access-20261102-144008.db\n/opt/aura-vpn-bot-next/backups/aura_vpn-before-web-20261102-140448.db\n/opt/aura-vpn-bot-next/aura_vpn.db\n/opt/nexo-hy2-candidate/aura_vpn.db\n/opt/nexo-bot/aura_vpn.db\n/opt/nexo-hy2-baseline/aura_vpn.db\n/root/aura-russia-off-2puoash3/x-ui.db\n\n[exited with code 0]\n","numLines":22,"startLine":1,"totalLines":22}},"displayPath":"../../../../private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/tasks/bnvrh6ek0.output"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"bb378666-5ec9-4d81-9ae1-d0993c4df673","timestamp":"2026-11-08T23:10:59.371Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nCalled the Read tool with the following input: {\"file_path\":\"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/tasks/bnvrh6ek0.output\"}\n</system-reminder>"},{"content":"<system-reminder>\nResult of calling the Read tool:\n1\tconfig.py:17:# Brand shown in the bot UI. Several bots (Aura VPN, Nexo) share this code and the database.\n2\tdatabase.py:1:\"\"\"AuraVPN Database — SQLite\"\"\"\n3\tdatabase.py:10:DB_PATH = os.environ.get(\n4\tdatabase.py:11:    \"AURA_DB_PATH\",\n5\tdatabase.py:12:    os.path.join(os.path.dirname(__file__), \"aura_vpn.db\"),\n6\tdatabase.py:17:    conn = sqlite3.connect(DB_PATH)\n7\tAURA_DB_PATH=\n8\t-rw-r--r-- 1 shagen shagen 102400 Nov  6 15:59 /opt/nexo-bot/aura_vpn.db\n9\tlrwxrwxrwx 1 root   root       21 Sep 26 13:16 /var/lib/aura-openflux -> private/aura-openflux\n10\t/home/shagen/migration/aura-vpn-bot-next-src/aura_vpn.db\n11\t/opt/aura-vpn-bot/aura_vpn.db\n12\t/opt/aura-vpn-bot-next/backups/aura_vpn-before-payments-20261031-223613.db\n13\t/opt/aura-vpn-bot-next/backups/aura_vpn-before-access-20261102-144008.db\n14\t/opt/aura-vpn-bot-next/backups/aura_vpn-before-web-20261102-140448.db\n15\t/opt/aura-vpn-bot-next/aura_vpn.db\n16\t/opt/nexo-hy2-candidate/aura_vpn.db\n17\t/opt/nexo-bot/aura_vpn.db\n18\t/opt/nexo-hy2-baseline/aura_vpn.db\n19\t/root/aura-russia-off-2puoash3/x-ui.db\n20\t\n21\t[exited with code 0]\n22\t\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.317","gitBranch":"feat/desktop-tun","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
{"parentUuid":"bb378666-5ec9-4d81-9ae1-d0993c4df673","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"file","filename":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/chain_patch.py","content":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/chain_patch.py","content":"import sys\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nroot = Path(sys.argv[1])\n\n\ndef patch(path, pairs):\n    file = root / path\n    text = file.read_text()\n    for old, new in pairs:\n        assert text.count(old) == 1, (path, old)\n        text = text.replace(old, new)\n    file.write_text(text)\n\n\npatch('nexo_client.py', [\n    (\"\"\"    names = [p['name'] for p in proxies]\n    visible_names = names\n    vienna_group = None\n    if any(p['type'] == 'hysteria2' for p in proxies):\n        server = os.environ.get('NEXO_HY2_SERVER')\n        vienna_names = [p['name'] for p in proxies if p['server'] == server]\n        other_names = [p['name'] for p in proxies if p['server'] != server]\n        country = '🇦🇹 Nexo — Вена'\n        visible_names = [country, *other_names]\n        vienna_group = {'name': country, 'type': 'fallback', 'proxies': vienna_names,\n                        'url': PROBE_URL, 'interval': 20, 'timeout': 3000, 'lazy': False}\n\"\"\", \"\"\"    names = [p['name'] for p in proxies]\n    visible_names = names\n    vienna_group = None\n    relayed_groups = []\n    if any(p['type'] == 'hysteria2' for p in proxies):\n        server = os.environ.get('NEXO_HY2_SERVER')\n        vienna_names = [p['name'] for p in proxies if p['server'] == server]\n        other_names = [p['name'] for p in proxies if p['server'] != server]\n        country = '🇦🇹 Nexo — Вена'\n        visible_names = [country, *other_names]\n        vienna_group = {'name': country, 'type': 'fallback', 'proxies': vienna_names,\n                        'url': PROBE_URL, 'interval': 20, 'timeout': 3000, 'lazy': False}\n        # Russian providers block other countries' addresses one by one; reaching them from Vienna keeps them usable,\n        # and the direct route stays as the backup for when Vienna itself is cut.\n        relayed = []\n        for proxy in proxies:\n            if proxy['server'] == server:\n                continue\n            name = proxy['name']\n            proxy['name'] = f'{name} напрямую'\n            relayed.append({**proxy, 'name': f'{name} через Вену', 'dialer-proxy': country})\n            relayed_groups.append({'name': name, 'type': 'fallback', 'proxies': [f'{name} через Вену', proxy['name']],\n                                   'url': PROBE_URL, 'interval': 60, 'timeout': 5000, 'lazy': False})\n        proxies += relayed\n\"\"\"),\n    (\"\"\"            *([vienna_group] if vienna_group else []),\n            *([{'name'\"\"\", \"\"\"            *([vienna_group] if vienna_group else []),\n            *relayed_groups,\n            *([{'name'\"\"\"),\n])\n\npatch('tests/test_hy2.py', [\n    (\"\"\"    def test_a_single_server_gets_no_service_choices(self):\"\"\",\n     \"\"\"    def test_other_countries_are_reached_through_vienna_first(self):\n        raw = f'vless://{KEY}@192.0.2.1:443?type=tcp&security=tls&sni=vpn.example.test&flow=xtls-rprx-vision#Vienna\\\\n'\n        raw += f'vless://{KEY}@192.0.2.2:443?type=tcp&security=reality&sni=www.example.test&pbk=pk&sid=ab#Brazil'\n        with patch.dict(os.environ, {'NEXO_HY2_SERVER':'192.0.2.1','NEXO_HY2_OBFS':'test-obfs'}):\n            result = nexo_client.profile(base64.b64encode(raw.encode()).decode())\n        proxies = {p['name']:p for p in result['proxies']}\n        groups = {g['name']:g for g in result['proxy-groups']}\n        self.assertEqual(groups['Brazil']['type'], 'fallback')\n        self.assertEqual(groups['Brazil']['proxies'], ['Brazil через Вену', 'Brazil напрямую'])\n        self.assertEqual(proxies['Brazil через Вену']['dialer-proxy'], '🇦🇹 Nexo — Вена')\n        self.assertEqual(proxies['Brazil через Вену']['server'], '192.0.2.2')\n        self.assertNotIn('dialer-proxy', proxies['Brazil напрямую'])\n        self.assertNotIn('dialer-proxy', proxies['Vienna'])\n        self.assertEqual(len(proxies), len(result['proxies']))\n\n    def test_a_single_server_gets_no_service_choices(self):\"\"\"),\n])\nprint('patched')\n","numLines":79,"startLine":1,"totalLines":79}},"displayPath":"../../../../private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/chain_patch.py"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"6b8efe4e-57dc-439e-b260-2f0847af4796","timestamp":"2026-11-08T23:10:59.371Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nCalled the Read tool with the following input: {\"file_path\":\"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/chain_patch.py\"}\n</system-reminder>"},{"content":"<system-reminder>\nResult of calling the Read tool:\n1\timport sys\n2\tfrom pathlib import Path\n3\t\n4\troot = Path(sys.argv[1])\n5\t\n6\t\n7\tdef patch(path, pairs):\n8\t    file = root / path\n9\t    text = file.read_text()\n10\t    for old, new in pairs:\n11\t        assert text.count(old) == 1, (path, old)\n12\t        text = text.replace(old, new)\n13\t    file.write_text(text)\n14\t\n15\t\n16\tpatch('nexo_client.py', [\n17\t    (\"\"\"    names = [p['name'] for p in proxies]\n18\t    visible_names = names\n19\t    vienna_group = None\n20\t    if any(p['type'] == 'hysteria2' for p in proxies):\n21\t        server = os.environ.get('NEXO_HY2_SERVER')\n22\t        vienna_names = [p['name'] for p in proxies if p['server'] == server]\n23\t        other_names = [p['name'] for p in proxies if p['server'] != server]\n24\t        country = '🇦🇹 Nexo — Вена'\n25\t        visible_names = [country, *other_names]\n26\t        vienna_group = {'name': country, 'type': 'fallback', 'proxies': vienna_names,\n27\t                        'url': PROBE_URL, 'interval': 20, 'timeout': 3000, 'lazy': False}\n28\t\"\"\", \"\"\"    names = [p['name'] for p in proxies]\n29\t    visible_names = names\n30\t    vienna_group = None\n31\t    relayed_groups = []\n32\t    if any(p['type'] == 'hysteria2' for p in proxies):\n33\t        server = os.environ.get('NEXO_HY2_SERVER')\n34\t        vienna_names = [p['name'] for p in proxies if p['server'] == server]\n35\t        other_names = [p['name'] for p in proxies if p['server'] != server]\n36\t        country = '🇦🇹 Nexo — Вена'\n37\t        visible_names = [country, *other_names]\n38\t        vienna_group = {'name': country, 'type': 'fallback', 'proxies': vienna_names,\n39\t                        'url': PROBE_URL, 'interval': 20, 'timeout': 3000, 'lazy': False}\n40\t        # Russian providers block other countries' addresses one by one; reaching them from Vienna keeps them usable,\n41\t        # and the direct route stays as the backup for when Vienna itself is cut.\n42\t        relayed = []\n43\t        for proxy in proxies:\n44\t            if proxy['server'] == server:\n45\t                continue\n46\t            name = proxy['name']\n47\t            proxy['name'] = f'{name} напрямую'\n48\t            relayed.append({**proxy, 'name': f'{name} через Вену', 'dialer-proxy': country})\n49\t            relayed_groups.append({'name': name, 'type': 'fallback', 'proxies': [f'{name} через Вену', proxy['name']],\n50\t                                   'url': PROBE_URL, 'interval': 60, 'timeout': 5000, 'lazy': False})\n51\t        proxies += relayed\n52\t\"\"\"),\n53\t    (\"\"\"            *([vienna_group] if vienna_group else []),\n54\t            *([{'name'\"\"\", \"\"\"            *([vienna_group] if vienna_group else []),\n55\t            *relayed_groups,\n56\t            *([{'name'\"\"\"),\n57\t])\n58\t\n59\tpatch('tests/test_hy2.py', [\n60\t    (\"\"\"    def test_a_single_server_gets_no_service_choices(self):\"\"\",\n61\t     \"\"\"    def test_other_countries_are_reached_through_vienna_first(self):\n62\t        raw = f'vless://{KEY}@192.0.2.1:443?type=tcp&security=tls&sni=vpn.example.test&flow=xtls-rprx-vision#Vienna\\\\n'\n63\t        raw += f'vless://{KEY}@192.0.2.2:443?type=tcp&security=reality&sni=www.example.test&pbk=pk&sid=ab#Brazil'\n64\t        with patch.dict(os.environ, {'NEXO_HY2_SERVER':'192.0.2.1','NEXO_HY2_OBFS':'test-obfs'}):\n65\t            result = nexo_client.profile(base64.b64encode(raw.encode()).decode())\n66\t        proxies = {p['name']:p for p in result['proxies']}\n67\t        groups = {g['name']:g for g in result['proxy-groups']}\n68\t        self.assertEqual(groups['Brazil']['type'], 'fallback')\n69\t        self.assertEqual(groups['Brazil']['proxies'], ['Brazil через Вену', 'Brazil напрямую'])\n70\t        self.assertEqual(proxies['Brazil через Вену']['dialer-proxy'], '🇦🇹 Nexo — Вена')\n71\t        self.assertEqual(proxies['Brazil через Вену']['server'], '192.0.2.2')\n72\t        self.assertNotIn('dialer-proxy', proxies['Brazil напрямую'])\n73\t        self.assertNotIn('dialer-proxy', proxies['Vienna'])\n74\t        self.assertEqual(len(proxies), len(result['proxies']))\n75\t\n76\t    def test_a_single_server_gets_no_service_choices(self):\"\"\"),\n77\t])\n78\tprint('patched')\n79\t\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.317","gitBranch":"feat/desktop-tun","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
