{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","hash":"075c9f20f9a38095d65367f076fec04fb13d3d34ac6e61eb131460da4eb7a144","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Господин Шаген, VPN через Вену сейчас работает у всех: ни у кого нет признаков проблем. Не работают Бразилия вне Nexo и оплата.\n\n**Что работает:**\n- **Сервер в Вене:** все программы на нём запущены (бот Nexo, бот Aura, подписки, панель, Hysteria и запасной канал для Karing). Нагрузка почти нулевая, памяти и места на диске хватает. За последний час в журналах нет ни одной ошибки, только безвредные служебные предупреждения панели.\n- **Клиенты подключены:**\n  - за последние 15 минут — 13 человек, сейчас на венском сервере 9 активных подключений;\n  - сейчас в сети, примерно с 16:36 до 16:39 по Москве: вы, Armenak, Ani, лилит, Тигран, Егор, Margarit, OLvov, Ваагн, karinе, aadvetyan и двое с сайта;\n  - сегодня, но не прямо сейчас: Haik был в 12:42, ещё двое с сайта заходили ночью и утром.\n- **С вашего домашнего интернета** Вена открывается и по основному порту, и по порту запасного канала.\n\n**Что не работает:**\n- **Бразилия в Happ и Karing.** Её адрес заблокирован, прямо к ней сейчас никто не подключён. В Nexo она работает через Вену.\n- **Оплата.** Клиенты не могут заплатить, пока на сервере не будет нового ключа Platega. Сессия по Platega ждёт от вас этот ключ.\n\n**Давно не заходили:** Ольга (@igolga23) — с 31 октября, Olga — с 8 октября, dianfilka — с 26 сентября. По серверу не видно, почему: они могли просто перестать пользоваться. Если нужно, можно написать им через рассылку в /admin."}]}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","hash":"bd5a4b4f483ffb56d635a457d56eb1c996dec30ab63b86e963ce98d518494c9c","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<system-reminder>\nAttribution for git commits and pull requests you create from here on (this replaces Claude Code's own earlier attribution guidance, such as a previous copy of this reminder; the user's own instructions about these lines, such as a CLAUDE.md or memory rule, take precedence over this reminder, but do not add attribution lines this reminder leaves out):\n- End git commit messages with:\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n- End pull request descriptions with:\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nThe user can follow this conversation from another device; to put a file in front of them there (a report, a screenshot, a built artifact), send it with SendUserFile.\n</system-reminder>\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Пока не надо"}]}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","hash":"481e38dd4f4ca9880a5caff3fc35b62d831a3cbf3d4c377a2bb1a2b08c10eba6","message":{"role":"system","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Note: /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/clients_patch.py was read before the last conversation was summarized, but the contents are too large to include. Use Read tool if you need to access it.\n\nCalled the Read tool with the following input: {\"file_path\":\"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/usage_report.py\"}\nResult of calling the Read tool:\n1\timport asyncio\n2\timport collections\n3\timport os\n4\timport sqlite3\n5\timport time\n6\t\n7\tfrom runtime_config import get_nodes\n8\tfrom xui_api import XUIClient\n9\t\n10\tdb = sqlite3.connect(f\"file:{os.environ['AURA_DB_PATH']}?mode=ro\", uri=True)\n11\tprint('payment attempts by user:', db.execute(\n12\t    \"select count(distinct tg_id), group_concat(distinct tariff) from payments\").fetchone())\n13\tprint('payments by day:', db.execute(\n14\t    \"select substr(created_at,1,10), status, count(*) from payments group by 1,2 order by 1\").fetchall())\n15\tprint('payment amounts:', db.execute(\"select amount, count(*) from payments group by 1\").fetchall())\n16\tdevice_of = {}\n17\tfor tg_id, uuid, platform, status in db.execute('select tg_id, uuid, platform, status from devices'):\n18\t    device_of[uuid] = (tg_id, platform, status)\n19\tfor tg_id, uuid in db.execute('select tg_id, vpn_uuid from users where vpn_uuid is not null'):\n20\t    device_of.setdefault(uuid, (tg_id, 'legacy', 'legacy'))\n21\t\n22\t\n23\tasync def main():\n24\t    now = time.time() * 1000\n25\t    seen = collections.defaultdict(lambda: [0, 0])\n26\t    unknown = 0\n27\t    for node in get_nodes():\n28\t        client = XUIClient(node.key)\n29\t        if not await client.login():\n30\t            print(node.key, 'login failed')\n31\t            continue\n32\t        result = await client._request('GET', f'/panel/api/inbounds/get/{client.inbound_id}')\n33\t        inbound = result['obj']\n34\t        import json\n35\t        settings = json.loads(inbound['settings']) if isinstance(inbound['settings'], str) else inbound['settings']\n36\t        email_uuid = {c.get('email'): c.get('id') for c in settings.get('clients', [])}\n37\t        online = await client._request('POST', '/panel/api/inbounds/onlines')\n38\t        online = set(online.get('obj') or []) if isinstance(online, dict) else set()\n39\t        used = day = 0\n40\t        if not node.enabled:\n41\t            continue\n42\t        for email, uuid in email_uuid.items():\n43\t            raw = await client._request('GET', f'/panel/api/inbounds/getClientTraffics/{email}')\n44\t            stat = raw.get('obj') if isinstance(raw, dict) and isinstance(raw.get('obj'), dict) else {}\n45\t            total = (stat.get('up') or 0) + (stat.get('down') or 0)\n46\t            last = stat.get('lastOnline') or 0\n47\t            key = device_of.get(uuid)\n48\t            if key is None:\n49\t                unknown += 1\n50\t                continue\n51\t            entry = seen[key[0]]\n52\t            entry[0] += total\n53\t            entry[1] = max(entry[1], last)\n54\t            used += total > 0\n55\t            day += last > now - 86400000\n56\t        print(node.key, 'enabled', node.enabled, 'clients', len(email_uuid), 'with traffic', used,\n57\t              'seen 24h', day, 'online now', len(online & set(email_uuid)))\n58\t    print('panel clients not in DB', unknown)\n59\t    names = dict(db.execute(\"select tg_id, coalesce(nullif(username,''), first_name) from users\").fetchall())\n60\t    rows = sorted(seen.items(), key=lambda kv: -kv[1][0])\n61\t    for tg_id, (total, last) in rows:\n62\t        when = time.strftime('%d.%m %H:%M', time.gmtime(last / 1000)) if last else '-'\n63\t        print(f'{names.get(tg_id, tg_id)!s:22} {total / 2**30:8.2f} GB  last {when}')\n64\t    print('users with any traffic', sum(1 for _, (t, _) in rows if t > 0),\n65\t          'active last 24h', sum(1 for _, (_, l) in rows if l > now - 86400000),\n66\t          'last 7d', sum(1 for _, (_, l) in rows if l > now - 7 * 86400000))\n67\t\n68\t\n69\tasyncio.run(main())\n70\t\n\nCalled the Read tool with the following input: {\"file_path\":\"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/users_report.py\"}\nResult of calling the Read tool:\n1\timport collections\n2\timport sqlite3\n3\timport sys\n4\t\n5\tdb = sqlite3.connect(f'file:{sys.argv[1]}?mode=ro', uri=True)\n6\tdb.row_factory = sqlite3.Row\n7\tSKIP = {'vless_link', 'token', 'uuid', 'vpn_uuid', 'request_id', 'node_targets', 'referral_code'}\n8\t\n9\tfor table in ('users', 'devices', 'payments'):\n10\t    print(table, [r[1] for r in db.execute(f'pragma table_info({table})')])\n11\t\n12\tuser_cols = [r[1] for r in db.execute('pragma table_info(users)')]\n13\tprint('\\nusers total', db.execute('select count(*) from users').fetchone()[0])\n14\tfor col in ('is_active', 'is_premium', 'server', 'brand', 'bot', 'platform', 'app', 'source'):\n15\t    if col in user_cols:\n16\t        print(col, dict(db.execute(f'select {col}, count(*) from users group by 1').fetchall()))\n17\texpiry = next((c for c in user_cols if 'expir' in c or c.endswith('_until') or c == 'paid_until'), None)\n18\tif expiry:\n19\t    print('expiry column', expiry)\n20\t    print('with access now', db.execute(f\"select count(*) from users where {expiry} > datetime('now')\").fetchone()[0])\n21\tprint('by signup day', db.execute(\"select substr(created_at,1,10) d, count(*) from users group by d order by d\").fetchall())\n22\t\n23\tprint('\\ndevices', db.execute('select count(*) from devices').fetchone()[0])\n24\tprint('device status', dict(db.execute('select status, count(*) from devices group by 1').fetchall()))\n25\tprint('device platform', dict(db.execute(\"select platform, count(*) from devices where status='active' group by 1\").fetchall()))\n26\tprint('users with an active device', db.execute(\"select count(distinct tg_id) from devices where status='active'\").fetchone()[0])\n27\t\n28\tprint('\\npayments', dict(db.execute('select status, count(*) from payments group by 1').fetchall()))\n29\tprint('paid sum', db.execute(\"select tariff, count(*), sum(amount) from payments where status='paid' group by 1\").fetchall())\n30\t\n31\tdevices = collections.defaultdict(list)\n32\tfor row in db.execute(\"select tg_id, platform, label, status from devices\"):\n33\t    devices[row['tg_id']].append(f\"{row['platform']}{'' if row['status'] == 'active' else '(' + row['status'] + ')'}\")\n34\tpaid = dict(db.execute(\"select tg_id, count(*) from payments where status='paid' group by 1\").fetchall())\n35\tcols = [c for c in user_cols if c not in SKIP]\n36\tprint('\\nLIST', cols)\n37\tfor row in db.execute('select * from users order by created_at'):\n38\t    shown = {c: row[c] for c in cols if c in ('username', 'first_name', 'created_at', 'is_active', 'is_premium', 'server')\n39\t             or c == expiry}\n40\t    print(row['tg_id'], shown, 'devices:', ','.join(devices.get(row['tg_id'], [])) or '-', 'paid:', paid.get(row['tg_id'], 0))\n41\t\n\nCalled the Read tool with the following input: {\"file_path\":\"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Projects-nexo-app/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/tasks/bnvrh6ek0.output\"}\nResult of calling the Read tool:\n1\tconfig.py:17:# Brand shown in the bot UI. Several bots (Aura VPN, Nexo) share this code and the database.\n2\tdatabase.py:1:\"\"\"AuraVPN Database — SQLite\"\"\"\n3\tdatabase.py:10:DB_PATH = os.environ.get(\n4\tdatabase.py:11:    \"AURA_DB_PATH\",\n5\tdatabase.py:12:    os.path.join(os.path.dirname(__file__), \"aura_vpn.db\"),\n6\tdatabase.py:17:    conn = sqlite3.connect(DB_PATH)\n7\tAURA_DB_PATH=\n8\t-r