{"parentUuid":"de7083e1-7c37-45d3-afb8-1ec5166c718d","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"91d163fa-4c33-4181-a871-4269cd8b22ce","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SgM8ZGpwWpruSaDnzXLzvx","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"github russia whitelist bypass mobile internet xray\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"mobile-internet · GitHub Topics · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/topics/mobile-internet\"},{\"title\":\"roskomnadzor · GitHub Topics · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/topics/roskomnadzor\"},{\"title\":\"whitelists-bypass · GitHub Topics · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/topics/whitelists-bypass\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - trymyfear/Russia-whitelist-bypass: Обход белых списков и глушилок мобильных операторов в РФ (VLESS + REALITY) · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/trymyfear/Russia-whitelist-bypass\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - igareck/vpn-configs-for-russia: 🗽Бесплатные и проверенные VPN/Tor конфигурации, работающие в РФ ⚪ Белые списки / обход белых списков ⚪ Free and checked VPN/Tor configurations that work in Russia ⚪ Whitelists bypass · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/igareck/vpn-configs-for-russia\"},{\"title\":\"vpn-for-russia · GitHub Topics · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/topics/vpn-for-russia\"},{\"title\":\"free-vpn-russia · GitHub Topics · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/topics/free-vpn-russia\"},{\"title\":\"Обход белых списков мобильного интернета РФ - застряли, ищем реальный опыт / Bypassing the Russian Federation's mobile internet whitelists—we're stuck, looking for real-world experience · Issue #650 · net4people/bbs · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/net4people/bbs/issues/650\"},{\"title\":\"Amnezia VPN\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amnezia_VPN\"}]\n\nThe search turned up a cluster of GitHub projects that combine Xray with Russian mobile \"whitelist\" bypass, though most are community-run and unaudited.\n\n- **Whitelist background:** A GitHub discussion describes mobile carriers in Russia that allow access only to a pre-approved list of resources and block everything else, and it says it's unclear whether bypass tools have been confirmed to work while a whitelist is active on a real phone. The goal is to bypass the \"whitelist\" restrictions on mobile internet (LTE), where the carrier only allows access to a pre-approved list of resources and blocks everything else at the network level. The same thread adds that being in a public CIDR list is weak evidence.\n- **Xray-based projects:** trymyfear/Russia-whitelist-bypass describes a two-link tunnel built on VLESS + REALITY. Its installer sets up Xray-core and runs a relay on a Russian host that connects to a foreign host and opens a reverse tunnel.\n- **Clients and config lists:** NullCoreDeveloper/v2whitelist is an open-source Android V2Ray/Xray client aimed at whitelist bypass on mobile internet. igareck/vpn-configs-for-russia publishes free VPN/Tor configurations for whitelist bypass, including mobile-specific VLESS Reality lists.\n- **Whitelist data:** A list of domains and IPs that stay live in Russia when mobile internet is restricted is maintained in the `hxehex/russia-mobile-internet-whitelist` repository, and escapingworm/russia-whitelist lists IP ranges in the whitelists of Russian mobile operators.\n- **Amnezia:** Wikipedia says Amnezia VPN supports modern blocking bypass protocols and works even where other VPNs don't work, and its paid tier offers Xray VLESS obfuscation.\n\nCaveats: these are third-party projects with varying levels of maintenance, and the search didn't verify any of them. Treat free configs and binaries with caution, and check the legal situation for VPN use in Russia before relying on them.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"d960cbd6-47cf-4ce5-8924-5b2e655d4704","timestamp":"2026-11-08T23:13:30.380Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"github russia whit