{"parentUuid":"72a5da48-532c-4862-a6a6-d0f2a812d4ab","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"91d163fa-4c33-4181-a871-4269cd8b22ce","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QqrKzF1kmeE5MLjmhuhbV1","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"olcRTC github telemost wbstream tunnel\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"github.com\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openlibrecommunity/olcrtc\"},{\"title\":\"olcRTC Documentation\",\"url\":\"https://docsearch.algolia.com/mcp/docs/repo/openlibrecommunity/olcrtc\"},{\"title\":\"Sign inSign up\",\"url\":\"https://hub.docker.com/r/ulfrasark/olcrtc\"},{\"title\":\"olcbox bin\",\"url\":\"https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/olcbox-bin\"},{\"title\":\"Sponsored by\",\"url\":\"https://gittrend.io/repo/openlibrecommunity/olcrtc\"},{\"title\":\"go library\",\"url\":\"https://mintlify.wiki/openlibrecommunity/olcrtc/go-library\"},{\"title\":\"quickstart scripts\",\"url\":\"https://mintlify.wiki/openlibrecommunity/olcrtc/quickstart-scripts\"},{\"title\":\"mintlify.wiki\",\"url\":\"https://mintlify.wiki/openlibrecommunity/olcrtc\"},{\"title\":\"habr.com\",\"url\":\"https://habr.com/ru/articles/1020114\"},{\"title\":\"mintlify.wiki\",\"url\":\"https://mintlify.wiki/openlibrecommunity/olcrtc/introduction\"},{\"title\":\"mintlify.wiki\",\"url\":\"https://mintlify.wiki/openlibrecommunity/olcrtc/troubleshooting\"},{\"title\":\"Documentation Index\",\"url\":\"https://mintlify.wiki/openlibrecommunity/olcrtc/providers-transports\"},{\"title\":\"manual build\",\"url\":\"https://mintlify.wiki/openlibrecommunity/olcrtc/manual-build\"},{\"title\":\"compatibility matrix\",\"url\":\"https://mintlify.wiki/openlibrecommunity/olcrtc/compatibility-matrix\"},{\"title\":\"pkg.go.dev\",\"url\":\"https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/haltman-io/rtc2tcp\"},{\"title\":\"Documentation Index\",\"url\":\"https://mintlify.wiki/openlibrecommunity/olcrtc/uri-format\"},{\"title\":\"awesome.ecosyste.ms\",\"url\":\"https://awesome.ecosyste.ms/projects/github.com%2Frtctunnel%2Frtctunnel\"}]\n\nolcRTC is an open-source encrypted tunnel that carries TCP traffic inside WebRTC video-call sessions on Telemost and WbStream, among other providers. The search results come mostly from the project's GitHub README and third-party documentation mirrors, so details may be out of date.\n\n- **What it is:** The GitHub repo describes it as an encrypted TCP-over-WebRTC tunnel, with the traffic disguised as an ordinary video call on allowed services (Jitsi, Yandex Telemost, WbStream).\n- **Telemost:** Setup requires a room ID from the Telemost site. Transport support is limited: one doc notes Telemost has removed DC support, and another says Telemost removed datachannel support. The usual choice there is vp8channel.\n- **WbStream:** Setup also needs a room ID from the WbStream site. Datachannel does not work for it in the guest flow, per one doc: WbStream + datachannel does not work in the normal guest flow. Suggested alternatives are vp8channel or seichannel. One guide describes wbstream + vp8channel as an alternative combo.\n- **Recommended setup:** The project suggests starting with Jitsi plus datachannel, since Jitsi is the most reliable option.\n- **Status:** One doc says olcRTC is currently in Beta. The GitHub project is released under the WTFPL license.\n\nI did not find a dedicated page specifically about a \"telemost wbstream tunnel\" combination beyond these general docs.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"1ee85f0a-0da9-46cd-939e-94ec120909e7","timestamp":"2026-11-08T23:14:41.624Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"olcRTC github telemost wbstream tunnel","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_014pk9zRJgQ6ftoHMdM9bsWu","content":[{"title":"github.com","url":"https://github.com/openlibrecommunity/olcrtc"},{"title":"olcRTC Documentation","url":"https://docsearch.algolia.com/mcp/docs/repo/openlibrecommunity/olcrtc"},{"title":"Sign inSign up","url":"https://hub.docker.com/r/ulfrasark/olcrtc"},{"title":"olcbox bin","url":"https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/olcbox-bin"},{"title":"Sponsored by","url":"https://gittrend.io/repo/openlibrecommunity/olcrtc"},{"title":"go library","url":"https://mintlify.wiki/openlibrecommunity/olcrtc/go-library"},{"title":"quickstart scripts","url":"https://mintlify.wiki/openlibrecommunity/olcrtc/quickstart-scripts"},{"title":"mintlify.wiki","url":"https://mintlify.wiki/openlibrecommunity/olcrtc"},{"title":"habr.com","url":"https://habr.com/ru/articles/1020114"},{"title":"mintlify.wiki","url":"https://mintlify.wiki/openlibrecommunity/olcrtc/introduction"},{"title":"mintlify.wiki","url":"https://mintlify.wiki/openlibrecommunity/olcrtc/troubleshooting"},{"title":"Documentation Index","url":"https://mintlify.wiki/openlibrecommunity/olcrtc/providers-transports"},{"title":"manual build","url":"https://mintlify.wiki/openlibrecommunity/olcrtc/manual-build"},{"title":"compatibility matrix","url":"https://mintlify.wiki/openlibrecommunity/olcrtc/compatibility-matrix"},{"title":"pkg.go.dev","url":"https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/haltman-io/rtc2tcp"},{"title":"Documentation Index","url":"https://mintlify.wiki/openlibrecommunity/olcrtc/uri-format"},{"title":"awesome.ecosyste.ms","url":"https://awesome.ecosyste.ms/projects/github.com%2Frtctunnel%2Frtctunnel"}]},"olcRTC is an open-source encrypted tunnel that carries TCP traffic inside WebRTC video-call sessions on Telemost and WbStream, among other providers. The search results come mostly from the project's GitHub README and third-party documentation mirrors, so details may be out of date.\n\n- **What it is:** The GitHub repo describes it as an encrypted TCP-over-WebRTC tunnel, with the traffic disguised as an ordinary video call on allowed services (Jitsi, Yandex Telemost, WbStream).\n- **Telemost:** Setup requires a room ID from the Telemost site. Transport support is limited: one doc notes Telemost has removed DC support, and another says Telemost removed datachannel support. The usual choice there is vp8channel.\n- **WbStream:** Setup also needs a room ID from the WbStream site. Datachannel does not work for it in the guest flow, per one doc: WbStream + datachannel does not work in the normal guest flow. Suggested alternatives are vp8channel or seichannel. One guide describes wbstream + vp8channel as an alternative combo.\n- **Recommended setup:** The project suggests starting with Jitsi plus datachannel, since Jitsi is the most reliable option.\n- **Status:** One doc says olcRTC is currently in Beta. The GitHub project is released under the WTFPL license.\n\nI did not find a dedicated page specifically about a \"telemost wbstream tunnel\" combination beyond these general docs."],"durationSeconds":5.241531917005777,"searchCount":1},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"2180d2a6-1ba3-4dee-99f8-a9ad3a6dbd27","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","root":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","branch":"feat/desktop-tun","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":2,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":2},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Shahen777/nexo-app","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Shahen777/nexo-app","visibility":"public"},{"name":"upstream","host":"github.com","remote":"chen08209/FlClash","visibility":"unknown"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Shahen777/nexo-app","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"72a5da48-532c-4862-a6a6-d0f2a812d4ab","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.317","gitBranch":"feat/deskt