{"parentUuid":"558207f0-b87e-4796-aaf4-e05c87bc9539","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a848df64-7745-459c-844e-0a1848e6d119","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MMWdc6mAuJSv7oj269hFqq","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Google Play VPN app policy VpnService organization account requirement 2026 personal account 12 testers\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Google ierobežos to VPN jaudu, kas filtrē datplūsmu un reklāmas Play veikalā\",\"url\":\"https://blog.desdelinux.net/lv/Google-ierobe%C5%BEos-VPN-jaudu%2C-kas-filtr%C4%93-trafiku-un-rekl%C4%81mas-Play-veikal%C4%81/\"},{\"title\":\"support.google.com\",\"url\":\"https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/10788890?authuser=4\"},{\"title\":\"Google will limit the capacity of VPNs that filter traffic and ads in the Play Store\",\"url\":\"https://blog.desdelinux.net/en/google-will-limit-the-capacity-of-vpns-that-filter-traffic-and-ads-in-the-play-store/\"},{\"title\":\"Google vil begrænse kapaciteten af ​​VPN'er, der filtrerer trafik og annoncer i Play Butik\",\"url\":\"https://blog.desdelinux.net/da/google-vil-begr%C3%A6nse-kapaciteten-af-%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8Bvpns%2C-der-filtrerer-trafik-og-annoncer-i-play-butikken/\"},{\"title\":\"Google piirab Play poes liiklust ja reklaame filtreerivate VPN-ide mahtu\",\"url\":\"https://blog.desdelinux.net/et/google-piirab-Play-poes-liiklust-ja-reklaame-filtreerivate-VPN-ide-mahtu/\"},{\"title\":\"www.ithome.com.tw\",\"url\":\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/152786\"},{\"title\":\"Google obmedzí kapacitu sietí VPN, ktoré filtrujú návštevnosť a reklamy v Obchode Play\",\"url\":\"https://blog.desdelinux.net/sk/google-obmedz%C3%AD-kapacitu-siet%C3%AD-VPN%2C-ktor%C3%A9-filtruj%C3%BA-n%C3%A1v%C5%A1tevnos%C5%A5-a-reklamy-v-obchode-Play/\"},{\"title\":\"Google Plans to Bar Android VPN Apps from Blocking or Interfering with Ads\",\"url\":\"https://www.bitdefender.com/en-au/blog/hotforsecurity/google-plans-to-bar-android-vpn-apps-from-blocking-or-interfering-with-ads\"},{\"title\":\"Google sẽ giới hạn khả năng của các VPN lọc lưu lượng truy cập và quảng cáo trong Cửa hàng Play\",\"url\":\"https://blog.desdelinux.net/vi/google-s%E1%BA%BD-gi%E1%BB%9Bi-h%E1%BA%A1n-dung-l%C6%B0%E1%BB%A3ng-c%E1%BB%A7a-vpns-l%E1%BB%8Dc-l%C6%B0u-l%C6%B0%E1%BB%A3ng-truy-c%E1%BA%ADp-v%C3%A0-qu%E1%BA%A3ng-c%C3%A1o-trong-c%E1%BB%ADa-h%C3%A0ng-ch%C6%A1i/\"},{\"title\":\"Google Plans to Bar Android VPN Apps from Blocking or Interfering with Ads\",\"url\":\"https://www.bitdefender.com/blog/hotforsecurity/google-plans-to-bar-android-vpn-apps-from-blocking-or-interfering-with-ads/\"},{\"title\":\"Google は、Play ストアでトラフィックと広告をフィルタリングする VPN の容量を制限します\",\"url\":\"https://blog.desdelinux.net/ja/Google-%E3%81%AF%E3%80%81Play-%E3%82%B9%E3%83%88%E3%82%A2%E3%81%AE%E3%83%88%E3%83%A9%E3%83%95%E3%82%A3%E3%83%83%E3%82%AF%E3%81%A8%E5%BA%83%E5%91%8A%E3%82%92%E3%83%95%E3%82%A3%E3%83%AB%E3%82%BF%E3%83%AA%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B0%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B-VPN-%E3%81%AE%E5%AE%B9%E9%87%8F%E3%82%92%E5%88%B6%E9%99%90%E3%81%97%E3%81%BE%E3%81%99/\"},{\"title\":\"google proibira vpns que interfiram ou bloqueiem anuncios em aplicativos android a partir de novembro\",\"url\":\"https://www.tabnews.com.br/gugadeschamps/google-proibira-vpns-que-interfiram-ou-bloqueiem-anuncios-em-aplicativos-android-a-partir-de-novembro\"},{\"title\":\"Google Play plans to ban Android VPN apps that block ads\",\"url\":\"https://www.techzine.eu/?p=87399\"},{\"title\":\"В Google Play вводят новые правила для VPN-сервисов, которые фильтруют рекламу и трафик\",\"url\":\"https://www.ixbt.com/live/comments/2425510\"},{\"title\":\"Google limitera la capacité des VPN qui filtrent le trafic et les publicités sur le Play Store\",\"url\":\"https://blog.desdelinux.net/fr/google-limitera-la-capacit%C3%A9-des-vpns-qui-filtrent-le-trafic-et-les-publicit%C3%A9s-dans-le-play-store/\"},{\"title\":\"support.google.com\",\"url\":\"https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/10788890?hl=en\"},{\"title\":\"Google Play, stop alle VPN per Android che bloccano la pubblicità\",\"url\":\"https://global.techradar.com/it-it/news/google-play-stop-alle-vpn-per-android-che-bloccano-la-pubblicita\"}]\n\nThe search turned up the core VPN policy requirements but nothing on a 12-tester rule, so that part of your query is unconfirmed.\n\n- **Organization account required:** Google's Play Console help page says developers must register as an Organization when creating an account for apps approved to use the VpnService class, alongside health and government apps. (support.google.com, answer 10788890, hl=en)\n- **Other account requirements:** The same page says a D-U-N-S number is needed for organization registration, and that the developer account information should match the Dun & Bradstreet profile.\n- **Policy conditions:** Coverage of the July policy update says VPNService may only be used by apps whose core function is VPN. Those apps must document their VpnService use in the Play listing and encrypt data from the device to the tunnel endpoint. The policy also bars using VpnService to collect personal data without disclosure, redirect or manipulate other apps' traffic for monetization, or manipulate ads that affect monetization. Reports say it took effect November 1. (Bitdefender and desdelinux summaries)\n- **Not found:** No results mentioned a 12-tester requirement or a rule that personal accounts can't publish VPN apps beyond the organization requirement. The 12-tester detail may be tied to personal account closed-testing rules, which I couldn't verify here. I also didn't find 2026-specific updates, so the November 2025 effective date is the most recent confirmed change in these results.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"fae22be0-e053-449c-aca8-43df92add3af","timestamp":"2026-11-09T20:56:50.588Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Google Play VPN app policy VpnService organization account requirement 2026 personal account 12 testers","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01XPS7Vzh6dEkHwtWv465nMg","content":[{"title":"Google ierobežos to VPN jaudu, kas filtrē datplūsmu un reklāmas Play veikalā","url":"https://blog.desdelinux.net/lv/Google-ierobe%C5%BEos-VPN-jaudu%2C-kas-filtr%C4%93-trafiku-un-rekl%C4%81mas-Play-veikal%C4%81/"},{"title":"support.google.com","url":"https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/10788890?authuser=4"},{"title":"Google will limit the capacity of VPNs that filter traffic and ads in the Play Store","url":"https://blog.desdelinux.net/en/google-will-limit-the-capacity-of-vpns-that-filter-traffic-and-ads-in-the-play-store/"},{"title":"Google vil begrænse kapaciteten af ​​VPN'er, der filtrerer trafik og annoncer i Play Butik","url":"https://blog.desdelinux.net/da/google-vil-begr%C3%A6nse-kapaciteten-af-%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8Bvpns%2C-der-filtrerer-trafik-og-annoncer-i-play-butikken/"},{"title":"Google piirab Play poes liiklust ja reklaame filtreerivate VPN-ide mahtu","url":"https://blog.desdelinux.net/et/google-piirab-Play-poes-liiklust-ja-reklaame-filtreerivate-VPN-ide-mahtu/"},{"title":"www.ithome.com.tw","url":"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/152786"},{"title":"Google obmedzí kapacitu sietí VPN, ktoré filtrujú návštevnosť a reklamy v Obchode Play","url":"https://blog.desdelinux.net/sk/google-obmedz%C3%AD-kapacitu-siet%C3%AD-VPN%2C-ktor%C3%A9-filtruj%C3%BA-n%C3%A1v%C5%A1tevnos%C5%A5-a-reklamy-v-obchode-Play/"},{"title":"Google Plans to Bar Android VPN Apps from Blocking or Interfering with Ads","url":"https://www.bitdefender.com/en-au/blog/hotforsecurity/google-plans-to-bar-android-vpn-apps-from-blocking-or-interfering-with-ads"},{"title":"Google sẽ giới hạn khả năng của các VPN lọc lưu lượng truy cập và quảng cáo trong Cửa hàng Play","url":"https://blog.desdelinux.net/vi/google-s%E1%BA%BD-gi%E1%BB%9Bi-h%E1%BA%A1n-dung-l%C6%B0%E1%BB%A3ng-c%E1%BB%A7a-vpns-l%E1%BB%8Dc-l%C6%B0u-l%C6%B0%E1%BB%A3ng-truy-c%E1%BA%ADp-v%C3%A0-qu%E1%BA%A3ng-c%C3%A1o-trong-c%E1%BB%ADa-h%C3%A0ng-ch%C6%A1i/"},{"title":"Google Plans to Bar Android VPN Apps from Blocking or Interfering with Ads","url":"https://www.bitdefender.com/blog/hotforsecurity/google-plans-to-bar-android-vpn-apps-from-blocking-or-interfering-with-ads/"},{"title":"Google は、Play ストアでトラフィックと広告をフィルタリングする VPN の容量を制限します","url":"https://blog.desdelinux.net/ja/Google-%E3%81%AF%E3%80%81Play-%E3%82%B9%E3%83%88%E3%82%A2%E3%81%AE%E3%83%88%E3%83%A9%E3%83%95%E3%82%A3%E3%83%83%E3%82%AF%E3%81%A8%E5%BA%83%E5%91%8A%E3%82%92%E3%83%95%E3%82%A3%E3%83%AB%E3%82%BF%E3%83%AA%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B0%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B-VPN-%E3%81%AE%E5%AE%B9%E9%87%8F%E3%82%92%E5%88%B6%E9%99%90%E3%81%97%E3%81%BE%E3%81%99/"},{"title":"google proibira vpns que interfiram ou bloqueiem anuncios em aplicativos android a partir de novembro","url":"https://www.tabnews.com.br/gugadeschamps/google-proibira-vpns-que-interfiram-ou-bloqueiem-anuncios-em-aplicativos-android-a-partir-de-novembro"},{"title":"Google Play plans to ban Android VPN apps that block ads","url":"https://www.techzine.eu/?p=87399"},{"title":"В Google Play вводят новые правила для VPN-сервисов, которые фильтруют рекламу и трафик","url":"https://www.ixbt.com/live/comments/2425510"},{"title":"Google limitera la capacité des VPN qui filtrent le trafic et les publicités sur le Play Store","url":"https://blog.desdelinux.net/fr/google-limitera-la-capacit%C3%A9-des-vpns-qui-filtrent-le-trafic-et-les-publicit%C3%A9s-dans-le-play-store/"},{"title":"support.google.com","url":"https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/10788890?hl=en"},{"title":"Google Play, stop alle VPN per Android che bloccano la pubblicità","url":"https://global.techradar.com/it-it/news/google-play-stop-alle-vpn-per-android-che-bloccano-la-pubblicita"}]},"The search turned up the core VPN policy requirements but nothing on a 12-tester rule, so that part of your query is unconfirmed.\n\n- **Organization account required:** Google's Play Console help page says developers must register as an Organization when creating an account for apps approved to use the VpnService class, alongside health and government apps. (support.google.com, answer 10788890, hl=en)\n- **Other account requirements:** The same page says a D-U-N-S number is needed for organization registration, and that the developer account information should match the Dun & Bradstreet profile.\n- **Policy conditions:** Coverage of the July policy update says VPNService may only be used by apps whose core function is VPN. Those apps must document their VpnService use in the Play listing and encrypt data from the device to the tunnel endpoint. The policy also bars using VpnService to collect personal data without disclosure, redirect or manipulate other apps' traffic for monetization, or manipulate ads that affect monetization. Reports say it took effect November 1. (Bitdefender and desdelinux summaries)\n- **Not found:** No results mentioned a 12-tester requirement or a rule that personal accounts can't publish VPN apps beyond the organization requirement. The 12-tester detail may be tied to personal account closed-testing rules, which I couldn't verify here. I also didn't find 2026-specific updates, so the November 2025 effective date is the most recent confirmed change in these results."],"durationSeconds":5.185016583000077,"searchCount":1},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"7be0098a-da50-4825-8b2f-ff1abe44291c","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","root":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","branch":"feat/desktop-tun","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":2,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":2},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Shahen777/nexo-app","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Shahen777/nexo-app","visibility":"public"},{"name":"upstr