{"parentUuid":"c998938e-1830-420f-81f2-125d1b81a7ac","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a848df64-7745-459c-844e-0a1848e6d119","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016kLv2eJBqHg39aiPnCUynK","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Apple App Store VPN app requirements organization developer account guideline 5.4 NetworkExtension 2026 Russia removal\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"TrustTunnel client for iOS removed from Russia’s App Store amid ongoing VPN crackdown\",\"url\":\"https://adguard-vpn.com/en/blog/trusttunnel-ios-banned-app-store-russia.html\"},{\"title\":\"Apple removes VPN proxy apps from Russia App Store amid Telegram crackdown\",\"url\":\"https://www.storyboard18.com/media-and-entertainment/apple-removes-vpn-proxy-apps-from-russia-app-store-amid-telegram-crackdown-93797.htm\"},{\"title\":\"Russia Accused of Forcing Apple to Remove VPNs from App Store\",\"url\":\"https://tech.co/news/russia-vpn-apps-removed-apple\"},{\"title\":\"habr.com\",\"url\":\"https://habr.com/ru/post/1016186\"},{\"title\":\"russia orders vpn apps removal on app store\",\"url\":\"https://www.ilounge.com/news/russia-orders-vpn-apps-removal-on-app-store\"},{\"title\":\"Apple removes AdGuard’s TrustTunnel from Russian App Store amid censorship push\",\"url\":\"https://www.techradar.com/vpn/vpn-services/adguards-open-source-vpn-client-removed-from-russias-apple-app-store\"},{\"title\":\"Apple removes custom VPN clients from Russian App Store amid Telegram crackdown\",\"url\":\"https://www.techradar.com/vpn/vpn-privacy-security/apple-removes-custom-vpn-clients-from-russian-app-store-amid-telegram-crackdown\"},{\"title\":\"AdGuard's TrustTunnel iOS client pulled from Russian App Store as VPN crackdown intensifies\",\"url\":\"https://www.tomsguide.com/computing/vpns/adguards-trusttunnel-ios-client-pulled-from-russian-app-store-as-vpn-crackdown-intensifies\"},{\"title\":\"apple removed 1 213 apps at russia s internet regulator s request in 2025\",\"url\":\"https://meduza.io/en/news/2026/05/25/apple-removed-1-213-apps-at-russia-s-internet-regulator-s-request-in-2025\"},{\"title\":\"Apple removes VPN apps at request of Russian authorities, say app makers\",\"url\":\"https://www.yahoo.com/tech/apple-removes-vpn-apps-request-185347910.html\"},{\"title\":\"• Send Us A Tip\",\"url\":\"https://techstory.in/apple-complies-with-russian-government-removes-vpn-apps-from-app-store/\"},{\"title\":\"Apple removes dozens of blocking bypass apps from Russian App Store at the request of Roskomnadzor\",\"url\":\"https://www1.ru/en/news/2026/03/28/apple-udalila-desiatki-prilozenii-dlia-obxoda-blokirovok-iz-rossiiskogo-app-store-po-trebovaniiu-roskomnadzora.html\"},{\"title\":\"apple removes adguards trusttunnel ios app from russian app store\",\"url\":\"https://cyberinsider.com/apple-removes-adguards-trusttunnel-ios-app-from-russian-app-store/\"},{\"title\":\"apple removes vpn apps at request of russian authorities say app makers\",\"url\":\"https://techcrunch.com/2024/07/08/apple-removes-vpn-apps-at-request-of-russian-authorities-say-app-makers\"},{\"title\":\"Apple Removes VPN Clients from Russian App Store Amid Telegram Crackdown, Reports Say\",\"url\":\"https://www.technadu.com/apple-removes-vpn-clients-from-russian-app-store-amid-telegram-crackdown-reports-say/624877/\"},{\"title\":\"Apple Removes VPN and Proxy Apps From Russian App Store\",\"url\":\"https://www.pulse.bot/defense/news/apple-removes-vpn-and-proxy-apps-from-russian-app-store-0faeedaf-6d82-4b2f-b868-dae3a524199b\"},{\"title\":\"vpn udalili iz app store\",\"url\":\"https://ateo.digital/en/blog/vpn-udalili-iz-app-store/\"}]\n\nThe search didn't turn up anything on the App Store guideline side of your query. Nothing returned covers guideline 5.4, organization developer account requirements, or NetworkExtension entitlements, so those parts need a different search, such as Apple's App Review Guidelines page directly.\n\nOn the Russia removals, the results are consistent:\n\n- **TrustTunnel (AdGuard), April 2026:** On April 28, 2026, AdGuard claimed to have received an email from Apple notifying them that the app would be removed because it \"includes content that is illegal in Russia.\" Apple cited Article 15.1 of the country's law on information technologies. The removal applies only to the Russian storefront: the app remains available globally, and Android users in Russia can still download it via Google Play.\n- **Custom and proxy clients, March 2026:** Reports said the regulator had shifted focus from mainstream, ready-to-use VPN services to more flexible tools — including custom VPN clients and proxy apps. One outlet reported these apps will no longer receive crucial software updates once delisted.\n- **Earlier waves:** Russian authorities demanded the removal of 1,213 apps from the App Store in 2025. In July 2024, at least 25 VPN apps were reported removed from the App Store in Russia, including NordVPN and PIA.\n\nSources differ on scope. Some reports describe the 2026 removals as a broad purge, while others note that mainstream services like NordVPN remain available, and the removals mainly hit configurable clients.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"78f045f6-6c27-4f8e-884c-5843ff56e30d","timestamp":"2026-11-09T20:56:51.110Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Apple App Store VPN app requirements organization developer account guideline 5.4 NetworkExtension 2026 Russia removal","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01EqYMZBrCUKGd2RP469Aw2C","content":[{"title":"TrustTunnel client for iOS removed from Russia’s App Store amid ongoing VPN crackdown","url":"https://adguard-vpn.com/en/blog/trusttunnel-ios-banned-app-store-russia.html"},{"title":"Apple removes VPN proxy apps from Russia App Store amid Telegram crackdown","url":"https://www.storyboard18.com/media-and-entertainment/apple-removes-vpn-proxy-apps-from-russia-app-store-amid-telegram-crackdown-93797.htm"},{"title":"Russia Accused of Forcing Apple to Remove VPNs from App Store","url":"https://tech.co/news/russia-vpn-apps-removed-apple"},{"title":"habr.com","url":"https://habr.com/ru/post/1016186"},{"title":"russia orders vpn apps removal on app store","url":"https://www.ilounge.com/news/russia-orders-vpn-apps-removal-on-app-store"},{"title":"Apple removes AdGuard’s TrustTunnel from Russian App Store amid censorship push","url":"https://www.techradar.com/vpn/vpn-services/adguards-open-source-vpn-client-removed-from-russias-apple-app-store"},{"title":"Apple removes custom VPN clients from Russian App Store amid Telegram crackdown","url":"https://www.techradar.com/vpn/vpn-privacy-security/apple-removes-custom-vpn-clients-from-russian-app-store-amid-telegram-crackdown"},{"title":"AdGuard's TrustTunnel iOS client pulled from Russian App Store as VPN crackdown intensifies","url":"https://www.tomsguide.com/computing/vpns/adguards-trusttunnel-ios-client-pulled-from-russian-app-store-as-vpn-crackdown-intensifies"},{"title":"apple removed 1 213 apps at russia s internet regulator s request in 2025","url":"https://meduza.io/en/news/2026/05/25/apple-removed-1-213-apps-at-russia-s-internet-regulator-s-request-in-2025"},{"title":"Apple removes VPN apps at request of Russian authorities, say app makers","url":"https://www.yahoo.com/tech/apple-removes-vpn-apps-request-185347910.html"},{"title":"• Send Us A Tip","url":"https://techstory.in/apple-complies-with-russian-government-removes-vpn-apps-from-app-store/"},{"title":"Apple removes dozens of blocking bypass apps from Russian App Store at the request of Roskomnadzor","url":"https://www1.ru/en/news/2026/03/28/apple-udalila-desiatki-prilozenii-dlia-obxoda-blokirovok-iz-rossiiskogo-app-store-po-trebovaniiu-roskomnadzora.html"},{"title":"apple removes adguards trusttunnel ios app from russian app store","url":"https://cyberinsider.com/apple-removes-adguards-trusttunnel-ios-app-from-russian-app-store/"},{"title":"app